om peers.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 107, "output_tokens": 68, "total_tokens": 175}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.4397e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Celebrities_1268", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In what year did \"Bob Ross\" die?\n\nOptions: \nA. 1986\nB. 1989\nC. 1995\nD. 1997\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Bob Ross passed away in 1995 due to complications from lymphoma. He was widely known for his television show \"The Joy of Painting\" and his calming demeanor. \n\n\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 108, "output_tokens": 43, "total_tokens": 151}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.1968e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Celebrities_1275", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of these celebrities was not a member of the Jackson 5?\n\nOptions: \nA. Marlon Jackson\nB. Tito Jackson\nC. Bo Jackson\nD. Jermaine Jackson\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The Jackson 5 was a famous musical group consisting of brothers Jackie, Tito, Jermaine, Marlon, and Michael Jackson. Marlon, Tito, and Jermaine Jackson wer