laying golf in La Moraleja, Madrid?\n\nOptions: \nA. Bing Crosby\nB. Elvis Presley\nC. Charlie Chaplin\nD. Groucho Marx\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Bing Crosby died on October 14, 1977, after suffering a heart attack while playing golf in La Moraleja, Madrid, Spain. Elvis Presley died earlier that year in Memphis, Tennessee, not in Spain. The correct answer is A.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 110, "output_tokens": 61, "total_tokens": 171}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.391e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Celebrities_3728", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Nikki Diamond portrayed which Gladiator in the 1992 TV show \"Gladiators\"?\n\nOptions: \nA. Nightshade\nB. Falcon\nC. Scorpio\nD. Jet\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Nikki Diamond was a well-known cast member of the original UK version of \"Gladiators,\" where she performed under the name Scorpio. She appeared on the show from its inception in 1992 until 1996.\n\n\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 99, "output_tokens": 56, "total_tokens": 155}, "provider": "Google AI Studio", "model_used": "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "requested_model": "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "invoked_at": "2026-08-05T17:08:07.922512+00:00"}, "cost": 0.00010875, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Celebrities_3788", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of these people is NOT a part of the Internet comedy group Mega64?\n\nOptions: \nA. Rocco Botte\nB. Shawn Chatfield\nC. Jon Jafari\nD. Derrick Acosta\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Jon Jafari, also known as \"JonTron,\" was a member of Mega64 but left the group years ago, though he was notably involved in the early days. Rocco Botte, Shawn Chatfield, and Derrick Acosta are core founding members who have remained central to the group. However, the question asks who is *not* a part of Mega64, and since Jon Jafari is no longer actively involved, the answer reflects current membership.\n\n\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 108, "output_tokens": 100, "total_tokens": 208}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.7668e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Celebrities_3793", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What is generally considered to be William Shakespeare's birth date?\n\nOptions: \nA. July 4th, 1409\nB. April 23rd, 1564\nC. December 1st, 1750\nD. September 29th, 1699\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "William Shakespeare is traditionally believed to have been born on April 23rd, 1564, although the exact date is not definitively recorded. This date is widely accepted based on his baptism record on April 26th, 1564, with the assumption that he was born three days prior. \n\n\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 132, "output_tokens": 73, "total_tokens": 205}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.6672e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Celebrities_3896", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which actress's real name was Frances Ethel Gumm?\n\nOptions: \nA. Marilyn Monroe\nB. Julie Andrews\nC. Judy Garland\nD. Doris Day\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Frances Ethel Gumm was the birth name of Judy Garland, who later became famous for her role as Dorothy in *The Wizard of Oz*. The other actresses listed had different birth names. Therefore, the correct answer is:\n\n\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 99, "output_tokens": 52, "total_tokens": 151}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.2229e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Celebrities_3968", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Gwyneth Paltrow has a daughter named...?\n\nOptions: \nA. Lily\nB. Dakota\nC. Apple\nD. French\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result