 or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The first Sherlock Holmes book written by Arthur Conan Doyle is \"A Study in Scarlet,\" published in 1887. It introduces the characters of Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson. The other options are either later Holmes stories or unrelated works.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 113, "output_tokens": 55, "total_tokens": 168}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.3522999999999999e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Books_1487", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: What is Hermione Granger's middle name?\n\nOptions: \nA. Jo\nB. Jane\nC. Jean\nD. Emma\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Hermione Granger's middle name is Jean, as confirmed by author J.K. Rowling in interviews and supplementary material. The name is often cited in official Harry Potter resources and fan references approved by Rowling. \n\n\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 91, "output_tokens": 49, "total_tokens": 140}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.1361e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Books_1523", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which Russian author wrote the epic novel War and Peace?\n\nOptions: \nA. Vladimir Nabokov\nB