rect letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The question appears to be fictional or based on a non-canonical source, as there is no official record of Superman teaming up with any celebrity to defeat an alien invasion in 1978. None of the listed celebrities\u2014Sylvester Stallone, Muhammad Ali, Mike Tyson, or Arnold Schwarzenegger\u2014appeared alongside Superman in any official media from that year. Therefore, the premise is likely made up, but if forced to choose based on pop culture crossovers, Muhammad Ali did team up with Superman in a 1980 animated short, \"Superman and the Muhammad Ali,\" where they fought an alien threat.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 111, "output_tokens": 137, "total_tokens": 248}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 2.1581e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Comics_3091", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In Black Hammer, what city did the heroes save from the Anti-God?\n\nOptions: \nA. Rockwood\nB. Mega-City One\nC. Star City\nD. Spiral City\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The heroes in *Black Hammer* saved Spiral City from the Anti-God during the climactic battle that led to their entrapment. This event is central to the origin story of the team in the comic series. \n\n\\boxed{D}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 104, "output_tokens": 50, "total_tokens": 154}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen