 Vectors\nD. Velocity\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Accelerator, a character from \"A Certain Magical Index,\" possesses the ability to control vectors, which include direction and magnitude of forces such as motion, acceleration, and energy. This power allows him to reflect attacks, fly, and manipulate physical interactions by altering vector directions. \n\n\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 100, "output_tokens": 60, "total_tokens": 160}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.31e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Japanese Anime & Manga_1224", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The heroine of \"Humanity Has Declined\" is a mediator between humans and what?\n\nOptions: \nA. The Earth\nB. Fairies\nC. Elves\nD. Animals\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The heroine of \"Humanity Has Declined\" serves as a mediator between humans and fairies in a post-apocalyptic world where humanity has declined and fairies have become prominent. The story revolves around her attempts to communicate and negotiate with these enigmatic fairy beings. \n\n\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 102, "output_tokens": 60, "total_tokens": 162}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.3242e-05, "accu