y correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In \"One Piece\", what does \"the Pirate King\" mean to the captain of the Straw Hat Pirates?\n\nOptions: \nA. Friendship\nB. Promise\nC. Adventure\nD. Freedom\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "To the captain of the Straw Hat Pirates, Monkey D. Luffy, \"the Pirate King\" represents the ultimate symbol of freedom\u2014being able to live without restrictions and sail the seas as one chooses. While adventure and friendship are important themes in \"One Piece,\" the core meaning Luffy associates with becoming Pirate King is freedom. This is consistently shown through his actions and beliefs throughout the series.\n\n\\boxed{D}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 104, "output_tokens": 85, "total_tokens": 189}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.5884e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "OpenTDB_Entertainment: Japanese Anime & Manga_3035", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: The animated film \"Spirited Away\" won the Academy Award for Best Animated Feature at the 75th Academy Awards in 2003.\n\nOptions: \nA. True\nB. False\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The animated film \"Spirited Away\" did indeed win the Academy Award for Best Animated Feature at the 75th Academy Awards, which were held in 2003. Therefore, the statement provided is accurate.\n\n\\boxed{A