nging gifts specifically suggests generosity. Therefore, the best description is that Sydney is generous afterwards.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 102, "output_tokens": 56, "total_tokens": 158}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.2841999999999998e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "SocialiQA_1575", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: Austin always wanted to have a big family, so Austin had three children.\n\nQuestion: How would you describe Austin?\n\nOptions: \nA. enjoys family\nB. satisfied\nC. selfish\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Austin chose to have three children because he always wanted a big family, which shows his desire for family life. This indicates a positive attitude toward family and relationships. Therefore, the best description is that Austin enjoys family.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 98, "output_tokens": 49, "total_tokens": 147}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.1858e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "SocialiQA_16368", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: Austin wanted to help so they dried Jesse's clothes for them.\n\nQuestion: How would you describe Austin?\n\nOptions: \nA. As a person who knows about jesse\nB. like a good friend\nC. As a helpful person\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. 