n.\n\nContext: Ash looked at their mother for approval as she performed her new trick.\n\nQuestion: How would you describe Ash?\n\nOptions: \nA. exciting\nB. lazy\nC. shy\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Ash sought approval from their mother, which suggests a desire for reassurance or validation. This behavior is most consistent with someone who is reserved or hesitant, rather than bold or lazy. Therefore, the best description is:\n\n\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 96, "output_tokens": 49, "total_tokens": 145}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.1716e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "SocialiQA_18483", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: Kai invited the new kid Casey to a movie with the rest of their friends.\n\nQuestion: How would you describe Kai?\n\nOptions: \nA. lerant\nB. humble\nC. friendly\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Kai invited the new kid Casey to a movie with their friends, which shows kindness and inclusiveness. This behavior is best described as friendly. \n\n\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 99, "output_tokens": 36, "total_tokens": 135}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.0629e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "SocialiQA_18511", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: Ash got hold of Casey to invite him to the ball that night.\n\nQuestion: How would you describe Ash?\n\nOptions: \nA. Viscious\nB. attracted to Ash\nC. Inviting\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The question asks how to describe Ash based on the context. Ash reached out to Casey to invite him to a ball, which indicates a social and welcoming action. The most accurate description from the options is \"Inviting,\" as it reflects Ash's action.\n\n\\boxed{C}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 101, "output_tokens": 57, "total_tokens": 158}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.2871e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "SocialiQA_18823", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: Kai walked home from school because they wanted to get some extra exercise.\n\nQuestion: How would you describe Kai?\n\nOptions: \nA. fatigued\nB. be fit\nC. pro life\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Kai chose to walk home from school to get extra exercise, which suggests a positive attitude toward physical fitness. This behavior indicates that Kai likely values health and staying active. Therefore, the best description is that Kai would \"be fit.\"\n\n\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 100, "output_tokens": 53, "total_tokens": 153}, "provider": "o