xt: Casey would stop in the middle of the road for no reason.\n\nQuestion: How would other drivers feel as a result?\n\nOptions: \nA. mad at Casey\nB. happy and joyous\nC. worried about whats in the road\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Other drivers would likely feel frustrated or angry if Casey suddenly stopped in the middle of the road for no apparent reason, as this could cause traffic disruptions or potential accidents. They would not be happy, nor would they automatically assume there's something in the road without context. Therefore, the most logical response is that they would be mad at Casey.\n\n\\boxed{A}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 108, "output_tokens": 74, "total_tokens": 182}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.5068e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "SocialiQA_22929", "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: Cameron went on all the rides in the park, and had a wonderful time all day.\n\nQuestion: How would Cameron feel afterwards?\n\nOptions: \nA. disappointed with the experience\nB. satisfied with the experience\nC. happy to get out of there\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Cameron went on all the rides and had a wonderful time all day, which indicates a positive experience. This suggests Cameron would feel pleased and fulfilled. Therefore, the most appropriate answer is:\n\n\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_