 becomes \u201c\u017eilo \u2026 pouze 471 pand\u201d (the verb is placed in the neuter singular to agree with the existential construction, and the noun appears in the genitive plural after the numeral).  \n- \u201cliving in captivity\u201d is rendered by the prepositional phrase \u201cv zajet\u00ed\u201d.  \n- \u201cat the end of last year\u201d is expressed by the temporal adverbial \u201cna konci minul\u00e9ho roku\u201d (or the slightly more concise \u201ckoncem lo\u0148sk\u00e9ho roku\u201d).\n\nPutting these elements together yields the fluent Czech sentence  \n\u201cNa konci minul\u00e9ho roku \u017eilo v zajet\u00ed pouze 471 pand.\u201d\n\n\\boxed{Na konci minul\u00e9ho roku \u017eilo v zajet\u00ed pouze 471 pand.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 168, "output_tokens": 170, "total_tokens": 338}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.000635, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_14", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nThe second was the We-Vibe vibrator for couples.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence to translate is \"The second was the We-Vibe vibrator for couples.\"\n\n- \"The second\" is rendered as \"Druh\u00fd\" (masculine, matching the implied item in a list).\n- \"Was\" translates directly to the past-tense form \"byl\".\n- The brand name \"We-Vibe\" is left unchanged.\n- \"Vibrator\" becomes the standard Czech equivalent \"vibr\u00e1tor\".\n- \"For couples\" is translated as the natural prepositional phrase \"pro p\u00e1ry\".\n\nCombining these elements produces the literal yet idiomatic Czech sentence \"Druh\u00fd byl We-Vibe vibr\u00e1tor pro p\u00e1ry.\"\n\n\\boxed{Druh\u00fd byl We-Vibe vibr\u00e1tor pro p\u00e1ry.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 163, "output_tokens": 145, "total_tokens": 308}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00056625, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_154", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nBank of England to keep interest rates at 0.25%\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "To translate \"Bank of England to keep interest rates at 0.25%\" into Czech, you can use the following phrasing, which is standard for news headlines:\n\n\\boxed{Bank of England ponech\u00e1 \u00farokov\u00e9 sazby na 0,25 %}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 38, "output_tokens": 57, "total_tokens": 95}, "provider": "Google", "model_used": "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "requested_model": "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "invoked_at": "2026-08-05T17:01:40.548988+00:00"}, "cost": 9.5e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_156", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nThe case appears to set a legal precedent, as there is no Massachusetts law that criminalises telling a person to commit suicide.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence concerns a legal matter (likely referencing the Michelle Carter case) and must be rendered in natural, idiomatic Czech while preserving the precise legal meaning.\n\n- \u201cThe case appears to set a legal precedent\u201d is most naturally expressed as \u201cP\u0159\u00edpad z\u0159ejm\u011b stanov\u00ed pr\u00e1vn\u00ed precedent.\u201d  \n- \u201cas there is no Massachusetts law\u201d becomes \u201cnebo\u0165 ve st\u00e1t\u011b Massachusetts neexistuje \u017e\u00e1dn\u00fd z\u00e1kon.\u201d  \n- \u201cthat criminalises telling a person to commit suicide\u201d is rendered \u201ckter\u00fd by kriminalizoval nab\u00e1d\u00e1n\u00ed osoby k sebevra\u017ed\u011b,\u201d using the standard legal term \u201cnab\u00e1d\u00e1n\u00ed k sebevra\u017ed\u011b.\u201d\n\nCombining these yields the fluent translation:\n\nP\u0159\u00edpad z\u0159ejm\u011b stanov\u00ed pr\u00e1vn\u00ed precedent, nebo\u0165 ve st\u00e1t\u011b Massachusetts neexistuje \u017e\u00e1dn\u00fd z\u00e1kon, kter\u00fd by kriminalizoval nab\u00e1d\u00e1n\u00ed osoby k sebevra\u017ed\u011b.\n\n\\boxed{P\u0159\u00edpad z\u0159ejm\u011b stanov\u00ed pr\u00e1vn\u00ed precedent, nebo\u0165 ve st\u00e1t\u011b Massachusetts neexistuje \u017e\u00e1dn\u00fd z\u00e1kon, kter\u00fd by kriminalizoval nab\u00e1d\u00e1n\u00ed osoby k sebevra\u017ed\u011b.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 177, "output_tokens": 248, "total_tokens": 425}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00084125, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_20", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nSimilarly, school sports teams cannot travel to tournaments or competitions in Tennessee, for example, with the financial support of their schools.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence to be translated discusses restrictions on school sports teams traveling to events in Tennessee without institutional funding. A natural and accurate Czech rendering begins with the adverbial connector \"Podobn\u011b\" (or the near-synonym \"Stejn\u011b tak\") to preserve the discourse function of \"Similarly.\"  \n\nThe subject noun phrase \"school sports teams\" is rendered as the compact Czech compound \"\u0161koln\u00ed sportovn\u00ed t\u00fdmy.\" The modal negation \"cannot travel\" becomes \"nemohou cestovat.\" The prepositional phrase \"to tournaments or competitions\" is translated with the synonymous pair \"na turnaje nebo sout\u011b\u017ee\" (or the slightly more formal \"\u010di\" for \"or\").  \n\nThe locative \"in Tennessee, for example\" is placed after the destination noun phrase and rendered \"v Tennessee nap\u0159\u00edklad,\" which correctly positions the exemplifying adverbial. Finally, the instrumental phrase \"with the financial support of their schools\" is expressed as \"s finan\u010dn\u00ed podporou sv\u00fdch \u0161kol,\" maintaining the possessive relation.  \n\nCombining these elements yields the fluent Czech sentence  \n\nPodobn\u011b nemohou \u0161koln\u00ed sportovn\u00ed t\u00fdmy cestovat na turnaje nebo sout\u011b\u017ee v Tennessee nap\u0159\u00edklad s finan\u010dn\u00ed podporou sv\u00fdch \u0161kol.  \n\nThis version respects Czech word-order conventions while preserving every semantic component of the original.\n\n\\boxed{Podobn\u011b nemohou \u0161koln\u00ed sportovn\u00ed t\u00fdmy cestovat na turnaje/sout\u011b\u017ee v TN nap\u0159. s finan\u010dn\u00ed podporou sv\u00fdch \u0161kol.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 177, "output_tokens": 312, "total_tokens": 489}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00100125, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_246", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nSince 2005, civil rights activists have returned to the Moore's Ford Bridge to recreate the night two black couples - Roger and Dorothy Malcom, and George and Mae Murray Dorsey - were lynched by the Ku Klux Klan in 1946.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Od roku 2005 se aktivist\u00e9 za ob\u010dansk\u00e1 pr\u00e1va vraceli na most Moore's Ford, aby znovu vytvo\u0159ili sc\u00e9nu noci, kdy v roce 1946 ob\u011bsili Ku Klux Klan dva \u010dern\u00e9 p\u00e1ry \u2013 Rogera a Dorothy Malcomovy a George a Mae Murray Dorseyovy.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Od roku 2005 se aktivist\u00e9 za ob\u010dansk\u00e1 pr\u00e1va vraceli na most Moore's Ford, aby znovu vytvo\u0159ili sc\u00e9nu noci, kdy v roce 1946 ob\u011bsili Ku Klux Klan dva \u010dern\u00e9 p\u00e1ry \u2013 Rogera a Dorothy Malcomovy a George a Mae Murray Dorseyovy.}}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 86, "output_tokens": 175, "total_tokens": 261}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 2.3606e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_330", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nAccording to a 2015 RAND study, DoD reimbursement rates do not include the cost of personnel, but do account for fuel, maintenance, and contracting costs.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Podle studie RAND z roku 2015 sazby pro n\u00e1hradu n\u00e1klad\u016f Ministerstva obrany nezahrnuj\u00ed n\u00e1klady na person\u00e1l, ale zahrnuj\u00ed n\u00e1klady na palivo, \u00fadr\u017ebu a smlouvy.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Podle studie RAND z roku 2015 sazby pro n\u00e1hradu n\u00e1klad\u016f Ministerstva obrany nezahrnuj\u00ed n\u00e1klady na person\u00e1l, ale zahrnuj\u00ed n\u00e1klady na palivo, \u00fadr\u017ebu a smlouvy.}}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 65, "output_tokens": 145, "total_tokens": 210}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.9115e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_38", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nWhen the active component was purified from the liquid, it turned out to be a byproduct of tryptophan metabolism known as indole-3-lactic acid.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Kdy\u017e byla aktivn\u00ed slo\u017eka izolov\u00e1na z kapaliny, uk\u00e1zalo se, \u017ee jde o vedlej\u0161\u00ed produkt metabolismu tryptofanu zn\u00e1m\u00fd jako kyselina indol-3-ml\u00e9\u010dn\u00e1.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Kdy\u017e byla aktivn\u00ed slo\u017eka izolov\u00e1na z kapaliny, uk\u00e1zalo se, \u017ee jde o vedlej\u0161\u00ed produkt metabolismu tryptofanu zn\u00e1m\u00fd jako kyselina indol-3-ml\u00e9\u010dn\u00e1.}}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 64, "output_tokens": 126, "total_tokens": 190}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.7144e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_446", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nHMX-1 crews frequently perform training flights around the Washington area and at the South Lawn to practice depositing the President of the United States at the White House with inches of precision.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Pos\u00e1dky HMX-1 \u010dasto prov\u00e1d\u011bj\u00ed cvi\u010dn\u00e9 lety v okol\u00ed Washingtonu a na Ji\u017en\u00ed tr\u00e1vn\u00edk, aby si procvi\u010dily p\u0159esn\u00e9 p\u0159ist\u00e1n\u00ed prezidenta Spojen\u00fdch st\u00e1t\u016f u B\u00edl\u00e9ho domu s p\u0159esnost\u00ed na palec.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Pos\u00e1dky HMX-1 \u010dasto prov\u00e1d\u011bj\u00ed cvi\u010dn\u00e9 lety v okol\u00ed Washingtonu a na Ji\u017en\u00ed tr\u00e1vn\u00edk, aby si procvi\u010dily p\u0159esn\u00e9 p\u0159ist\u00e1n\u00ed prezidenta Spojen\u00fdch st\u00e1t\u016f u B\u00edl\u00e9ho domu s p\u0159esnost\u00ed na palec.}}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 67, "output_tokens": 157, "total_tokens": 224}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 2.0457e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_458", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nDo you have patients with Alzheimer's in your family?\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence to be translated is \"Do you have patients with Alzheimer's in your family?\"\n\n- \"Do you have\" translates directly as \"M\u00e1te\".\n- \"patients with Alzheimer's\" translates as \"pacienty s Alzheimerovou chorobou\" (using the standard Czech medical term for the disease).\n- \"in your family\" translates as \"ve sv\u00e9 rodin\u011b\" (the reflexive \"sv\u00e9\" is the natural choice in Czech for \"your\" in this context).\n\nCombining these elements produces the full, grammatically correct Czech sentence \"M\u00e1te ve sv\u00e9 rodin\u011b pacienty s Alzheimerovou chorobou?\"\n\n\\boxed{M\u00e1te ve sv\u00e9 rodin\u011b pacienty s Alzheimerovou chorobou?}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 162, "output_tokens": 147, "total_tokens": 309}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00057, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_460", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nThe Cretaceous was a time when giant theropods, meat-eating dinosaurs that stood on two legs, roamed the Earth.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence translates naturally into Czech as follows, preserving both the geological terminology and the descriptive appositive phrase:\n\nK\u0159\u00edda byla dobou, kdy po Zemi kr\u00e1\u010deli ob\u0159\u00ed teropodi, maso\u017erav\u00ed dinosau\u0159i, kte\u0159\u00ed st\u00e1li na dvou noh\u00e1ch.\n\n- \u201cThe Cretaceous\u201d is rendered by the established Czech geological term *K\u0159\u00edda*.  \n- \u201cWas a time when\u201d becomes the idiomatic *byla dobou, kdy*.  \n- \u201cGiant theropods\u201d is *ob\u0159\u00ed teropodi* (the scientific name remains unchanged).  \n- The explanatory clause \u201cmeat-eating dinosaurs that stood on two legs\u201d is kept as a comma-separated apposition: *maso\u017erav\u00ed dinosau\u0159i, kte\u0159\u00ed st\u00e1li na dvou noh\u00e1ch*.  \n- \u201cRoamed the Earth\u201d is expressed by the conventional collocation *po Zemi kr\u00e1\u010deli*.\n\nThe resulting Czech sentence is grammatically correct, stylistically neutral, and faithful to the original meaning.\n\n\\boxed{K\u0159\u00edda byla dobou, kdy po Zemi kr\u00e1\u010deli ob\u0159\u00ed teropodi, maso\u017erav\u00ed dinosau\u0159i, kte\u0159\u00ed st\u00e1li na dvou noh\u00e1ch.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 177, "output_tokens": 266, "total_tokens": 443}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00088625, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_504", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nVictor (Ken Marino) still hasn't lost his virginity.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence to be translated is \u201cVictor (Ken Marino) still hasn\u2019t lost his virginity.\u201d\n\n- Proper names and parenthetical credits are left unchanged: \u201cVictor (Ken Marino)\u201d.\n- The English present-perfect construction \u201chasn\u2019t lost\u201d is rendered by the Czech perfective verb \u201cnep\u0159i\u0161el o\u201d.\n- The adverb \u201cstill\u201d is expressed by \u201cst\u00e1le\u201d.\n- The idiom \u201clost his virginity\u201d is conventionally translated as \u201cp\u0159i\u0161el o panictv\u00ed\u201d (the masculine form of \u201cvirginity\u201d).\n\nCombining these elements yields the natural Czech sentence  \n\u201cVictor (Ken Marino) st\u00e1le nep\u0159i\u0161el o panictv\u00ed.\u201d\n\n\\boxed{Victor (Ken Marino) st\u00e1le nep\u0159i\u0161el o panictv\u00ed.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 163, "output_tokens": 151, "total_tokens": 314}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00058125, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_51", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nSymptoms of poisoning include nausea, vomiting, headaches and fainting.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence translates naturally into Czech medical terminology as follows:\n\n- \"Symptoms\" \u2192 \"P\u0159\u00edznky\"\n- \"of poisoning\" \u2192 \"otravy\"\n- \"include\" \u2192 \"zahrnuj\u00ed\"\n- \"nausea\" \u2192 \"nevolnost\"\n- \"vomiting\" \u2192 \"zvracen\u00ed\"\n- \"headaches\" \u2192 \"bolesti hlavy\"\n- \"fainting\" \u2192 \"mdloby\"\n\nThis yields the fluent rendering \"P\u0159\u00edznaky otravy zahrnuj\u00ed nevolnost, zvracen\u00ed, bolesti hlavy a mdloby.\"\n\n\\boxed{P\u0159\u00edznaky otravy zahrnuj\u00ed nevolnost, zvracen\u00ed, bolesti hlavy a mdloby.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 165, "output_tokens": 154, "total_tokens": 319}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00059125, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_563", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nBrooks is a 71-year-old former Georgia state congressman and lifelong civil rights activist.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Brooks je 71let\u00fd b\u00fdval\u00fd poslanec st\u00e1tn\u00edho parlamentu Georgie a celo\u017eivotn\u00ed aktivista za ob\u010dansk\u00e1 pr\u00