s": 172, "output_tokens": 221, "total_tokens": 393}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.0007675, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_573", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nCells that are capable of triggering inflammation are balanced by cells that promote tolerance, protecting the body without damaging sensitive tissues.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence describes a balance in the immune system between pro-inflammatory and tolerance-promoting cells. A natural and accurate Czech translation must preserve this meaning while using appropriate immunological terminology and fluid sentence structure:\n\n- \"Cells that are capable of triggering inflammation\" translates as \"Bu\u0148ky, kter\u00e9 dok\u00e1\u017eou vyvolat z\u00e1n\u011bt\".\n- \"are balanced by cells that promote tolerance\" translates as \"jsou vyv\u00e1\u017eeny bu\u0148kami, kter\u00e9 podporuj\u00ed toleranci\".\n- The participial clause \"protecting the body without damaging sensitive tissues\" is rendered as the adverbial continuation \"a chr\u00e1n\u00ed tak t\u011blo, ani\u017e by po\u0161kodily citliv\u00e9 tk\u00e1n\u011b\" to maintain grammatical flow and avoid awkward participle stacking.\n\nCombining these yields the complete translation \"Bu\u0148ky, kter\u00e9 dok\u00e1\u017eou vyvolat z\u00e1n\u011bt, jsou vyv\u00e1\u017eeny bu\u0148kami, kter\u00e9 podporuj\u00ed toleranci, a chr\u00e1n\u00ed tak t\u011blo, ani\u017e by po\u0161kodily citliv\u00e9 tk\u00e1n\u011b.\"\n\n\\boxed{Bu\u0148ky, kter\u00e9 dok\u00e1\u017eou vyvolat z\u00e1n\u011bt, jsou vyv\u00e1\u017eeny bu\u0148kami podporuj\u00edc\u00edmi toleranci, chr\u00e1n\u00edc\u00edmi t\u011blo bez po\u0161kozen\u00ed citliv\u00fdch tk\u00e1n\u00ed.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 175, "output_tokens": 267, "total_tokens": 442}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00088625, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_656", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nFifteen-year-old Cao Cao was released into a nature reserve at the beginning of the panda mating season on 11 March.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{Patn\u00e1ctilet\u00fd Cao Cao byl propu\u0161t\u011bn do p\u0159\u00edrodn\u00ed rezervace na za\u010d\u00e1tku p\u00e1\u0159ic\u00ed sez\u00f3ny pand dne 11. b\u0159ezna.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 59, "output_tokens": 56, "total_tokens": 115}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 9.789e-06, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_72", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nCivil rights group issues travel warning for Missouri\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence to translate is the English headline \"Civil rights group issues travel warning for Missouri\" (noting the minor typo \"Englisb\" in the query, which is irrelevant to the translation task).\n\n- \"Civil rights group\" translates naturally to Czech as \"Skupina pro ob\u010dansk\u00e1 pr\u00e1va\" (a standard rendering for an advocacy organization).\n- \"Issues\" is rendered in the present tense as \"vyd\u00e1v\u00e1\" to match the source.\n- \"Travel warning\" is idiomatically \"varov\u00e1n\u00ed p\u0159ed cestov\u00e1n\u00edm\" (or \"cestovn\u00ed varov\u00e1n\u00ed\"), reflecting a caution about travel.\n- \"For Missouri\" becomes \"do Missouri\", preserving the place name as-is (standard in Czech) and indicating destination.\n\nCombining these yields the fluent Czech headline translation \"Skupina pro ob\u010dansk\u00e1 pr\u00e1va vyd\u00e1v\u00e1 varov\u00e1n\u00ed p\u0159ed cestov\u00e1n\u00edm do Missouri\", which maintains the original's concise, newswire style.\n\n\\boxed{Skupina pro ob\u010dansk\u00e1 pr\u00e1va vyd\u00e1v\u00e1 varov\u00e1n\u00ed p\u0159ed cestov\u00e1n\u00edm do Missouri}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 161, "output_tokens": 225, "total_tokens": 386}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00076375, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_735", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nConvercent has nearly 600 clients, including Airbnb, Microsoft, and Tesla.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Convercent m\u00e1 t\u00e9m\u011b\u0159 600 klient\u016f, mezi nimi\u017e jsou Airbnb, Microsoft a Tesla.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Convercent m\u00e1 t\u00e9m\u011b\u0159 600 klient\u016f, mezi nimi\u017e jsou Airbnb, Microsoft a Tesla.}}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 49, "output_tokens": 63, "total_tokens": 112}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 9.779e-06, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_781", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nNew York was joined in the case by California, Connecticut, Delaware, Illinois, Iowa, Maine, Massachusetts, Minnesota, New Mexico, Oregon, Pennsylvania, Rhode Island, Vermont and Washington, and the District of Columbia.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence describes U.S. states joining New York in a legal proceeding, so the Czech rendering must preserve the legal/joined-party sense while adapting the list of proper names to conventional Czech forms.\n\n- Begin with the inverted construction \u201cK New Yorku se \u2026 p\u0159ipojily,\u201d which naturally conveys that the listed jurisdictions joined New York.  \n- Retain unchanged those state names that are identical in Czech (Connecticut, Delaware, Illinois, Iowa, Maine, Massachusetts, Minnesota, Oregon, Rhode Island, Vermont, Washington).  \n- Apply the standard Czech exonyms for the remaining items: Kalifornie, Nov\u00e9 Mexiko, Pensylv\u00e1nie.  \n- Keep the official designation \u201cDistrict of Columbia\u201d as it is conventionally left untranslated in Czech legal contexts.  \n- Reproduce the original Oxford-comma-free list and the final \u201cand \u2026 and\u201d coordination exactly.\n\nThe resulting Czech sentence is therefore:\n\nK New Yorku se v p\u0159\u00edpadu p\u0159ipojily Kalifornie, Connecticut, Delaware, Illinois, Iowa, Maine, Massachusetts, Minnesota, Nov\u00e9 Mexiko, Oregon, Pensylv\u00e1nie, Rhode Island, Vermont a Washington a District of Columbia.\n\n\\boxed{K New Yorku se v p\u0159\u00edpadu p\u0159ipojily Kalifornie, Connecticut, Delaware, Illinois, Iowa, Maine, Massachusetts, Minnesota, Nov\u00e9 Mexiko, Oregon, Pensylv\u00e1nie, Rhode Island, Vermont a Washington a District of Columbia.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 196, "output_tokens": 297, "total_tokens": 493}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.0009875, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_79", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nFormer European No 1 Ronan Rafferty will be hoping for home comforts over the next three days as the Renaissance Club in East Lothian hosts the 25th edition of the Scottish Senior Open.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "B\u00fdval\u00fd evropsk\u00fd hr\u00e1\u010d \u010d\u00edslo 1 Ronan Rafferty bude nad\u011bji na dom\u00e1c\u00ed p\u0159\u00edzniv\u00e9 podm\u00ednky v n\u00e1sleduj\u00edc\u00edch t\u0159ech dnech, kdy klub Renaissance v East Lothianu po\u0159\u00e1d\u00e1 25. ro\u010dn\u00edk Scottish Senior Open.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{B\u00fdval\u00fd evropsk\u00fd hr\u00e1\u010d \u010d\u00edslo 1 Ronan Rafferty bude nad\u011bji na dom\u00e1c\u00ed p\u0159\u00edzniv\u00e9 podm\u00ednky v n\u00e1sleduj\u00edc\u00edch t\u0159ech dnech, kdy klub Renaissance v East Lothianu po\u0159\u00e1d\u00e1 25. ro\u010dn\u00edk Scottish Senior Open.}}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 73, "output_tokens": 167, "total_tokens": 240}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 2.1883e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_824", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nIn April 1946, a Supreme Court ruling enabled black citizens in Georgia to cast ballots for the first time during the primary race later that summer.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "V dubnu 1946 umo\u017enilo rozhodnut\u00ed Nejvy\u0161\u0161\u00edho soudu \u010dern\u00fdm ob\u010dan\u016fm v Georgii poprv\u00e9 hlasovat v p\u0159edvolebn\u00ed prim\u00e1rce pozd\u011bji v tom\u00e9m\u017e l\u00e9t\u011b.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{V dubnu 1946 umo\u017enilo rozhodnut\u00ed Nejvy\u0161\u0161\u00edho soudu \u010dern\u00fdm ob\u010dan\u016fm v Georgii poprv\u00e9 hlasovat v p\u0159edvolebn\u00ed prim\u00e1rce pozd\u011bji v tom\u00e9m\u017e l\u00e9t\u011b.}}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 62, "output_tokens": 139, "total_tokens": 201}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.8302e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_85", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nThe Mirror.co.uk reported on the sale.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence to translate is \"The Mirror.co.uk reported on the sale.\"\n\n- \"Mirror.co.uk\" is a proper name (a UK news website) and is left unchanged.\n- \"Reported on\" is rendered in the past tense as the natural Czech verb \"informoval o\".\n- \"The sale\" translates directly to \"prodeji\" (locative case after the preposition \"o\").\n\nCombining these elements produces the fluent Czech sentence \"Mirror.co.uk informoval o prodeji.\"\n\n\\boxed{Mirror.co.uk informoval o prodeji.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 161, "output_tokens": 112, "total_tokens": 273}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00048125, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_882", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nGlint secured $10 million in November from Bessemer Venture Partners, bringing its total funding to $60 million.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Glint z\u00edskal v listopadu od spole\u010dnosti Bessemer Venture Partners 10 milion\u016f dolar\u016f, \u010d\u00edm\u017e se jeho celkov\u00e9 financov\u00e1n\u00ed zv\u00fd\u0161ilo na 60 milion\u016f dolar\u016f.\n\n\\boxed{{Glint z\u00edskal v listopadu od spole\u010dnosti Bessemer Venture Partners 10 milion\u016f dolar\u016f, \u010d\u00edm\u017e se jeho celkov\u00e9 financov\u00e1n\u00ed zv\u00fd\u0161ilo na 60 milion\u016f dolar\u016f.}}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 56, "output_tokens": 124, "total_tokens": 180}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.6376e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_883", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nIn 2003, the province was officially split into Papua and West Papua, with independent Papua New Guinea occupying the eastern part of the island.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "V roce 2003 byla provincie ofici\u00e1ln\u011b rozd\u011blena na Papua a Z\u00e1padn\u00ed Papua, p\u0159i\u010dem\u017e nez\u00e1visl\u00e1 Papua-Nov\u00e1 Guinea obsadila v\u00fdchodn\u00ed \u010d\u00e1st ostrova.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{V roce 2003 byla provincie ofici\u00e1ln\u011b rozd\u011blena na Papua a Z\u00e1padn\u00ed Papua, p\u0159i\u010dem\u017e nez\u00e1visl\u00e1 Papua-Nov\u00e1 Guinea obsadila v\u00fdchodn\u00ed \u010d\u00e1st ostrova.}}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 61, "output_tokens": 114, "total_tokens": 175}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.5731e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-cs-en_976", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from Englisb to Czech.\n\nThe U.S. Environmental Protection Agency reversed a decision to delay an Obama-era rule requiring states to curb smog-causing emissions, one day after 15 states sued the agency over the move.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{Americk\u00e1 agentura pro ochranu \u017eivotn\u00edho prost\u0159ed\u00ed obr\u00e1tila rozhodnut\u00ed odkl\u00e1dat pravidlo z dob vl\u00e1dy Obamy, kter\u00e9 vy\u017eaduje, aby st\u00e1ty omezily emise zp\u016fsobuj\u00edc\u00ed smog, a to den pot\u00e9, co proti agentu\u0159e \u017ealovalo 15 st\u00e1t\u016f kv\u016fli tomuto kroku.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 70, "output_tokens": 106, "total_tokens": 176}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.5570000000000002e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_101", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nEven if these researchers do not attribute the break-off of this gigantic iceberg to climate change, nevertheless, very many ice shelfs in the Antarctic Peninsula have crumbled in recent decades.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The English sentence can be translated into German by rendering each clause as naturally and idiomatically as possible while preserving the concessive structure (\u201ceven if \u2026 nevertheless\u201d).\n\n- \u201cEven if\u201d becomes the standard concessive conjunction \u201cAuch wenn\u201d.  \n- \u201cthese researchers do not attribute \u2026 to climate change\u201d is expressed with the verb \u201czuschreiben\u201d plus dative: \u201cdiese Forscher \u2026 nicht dem Klimawandel zuschreiben\u201d.  \n- \u201cthe break-off of this gigantic iceberg\u201d is rendered by the compound noun \u201cder Abbruch dieses gigantischen Eisbergs\u201d.  \n- The contrasting clause is introduced by \u201cdennoch\u201d placed immediately after the comma, followed by the subject\u2013verb inversion required in German.  \n- \u201cvery many ice shelves\u201d is translated as \u201csehr viele Eisschelfe\u201d (the accepted plural of \u201cEisschelf\u201d).  \n- \u201cAntarctic Peninsula\u201d is the conventional geographic name \u201cAntarktische Halbinsel\u201d.  \n- \u201chave crumbled in recent decades\u201d is conveyed by \u201csind \u2026 in den letzten Jahrzehnten zerbrochen\u201d, which is the usual collocation for ice-shelf disintegration.\n\nPutting these elements together yields a fluent, accurate German sentence:\n\nAuch wenn diese Forscher den Abbruch dieses gigantischen Eisbergs nicht dem Klimawandel zuschreiben, sind dennoch sehr viele Eisschelfe auf der Antarktischen Halbinsel in den letzten Jahrzehnten zerbrochen.\n\n\\boxed{Auch wenn diese Forscher den Abbruch dieses gigantischen Eisbergs nicht dem Klimawandel zuschreiben, sind dennoch sehr viele Eisschelfe auf der Antarktischen Halbinsel in den letzten Jahrzehnten zerbrochen.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 185, "output_tokens": 345, "total_tokens": 530}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00109375, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_125", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe French army commander had occupied Bavaria since the spring in 1800, during the War of the Second Coalition with Austria.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{Der franz\u00f6sische Armeekommandant hatte Bayern seit dem Fr\u00fchjahr 1800 w\u00e4hrend des Krieges der Zweiten Koalition gegen \u00d6sterreich besetzt.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 56, "output_tokens": 44, "total_tokens": 100}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 8.375999999999999e-06, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_130", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThis affects the lifespan of lavender.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{Dies beeinflusst die Lebensdauer von Lavendel.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 35, "output_tokens": 20, "total_tokens": 55}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 4.484999999999999e-06, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_143", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe young animals may well be different from the other young animals (chicks), but belongs amongst them.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The given English sentence contains a minor grammatical inconsistency (plural subject paired with a singular verb), but this does not materially affect the translation. A natural, idiomatic rendering into German is therefore:\n\nDie jungen Tiere k\u00f6nnen sich durchaus von den anderen jungen Tieren (K\u00fcken) unterscheiden, geh\u00f6ren aber zu ihnen.\n\nThis preserves both the concessive meaning (\u201cmay well be different \u2026 but \u2026\u201d) and the parenthetical clarification while restoring subject\u2013verb agreement.\n\n\\boxed{Die jungen Tiere k\u00f6nnen sich durchaus von den anderen jungen Tieren (K\u00fcken) unterscheiden, geh\u00f6ren aber zu ihnen.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 171, "output_tokens": 125, "total_tokens": 296}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00052625, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_159", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe Fischerbach pasture fence project is a successful project and will be continued next year.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence to be translated is \u201cThe Fischerbach pasture fence project is a successful project and will be continued next year.\u201d\n\n- \u201cFischerbach\u201d is treated as an invariant proper noun and is retained unchanged.  \n- \u201cPasture fence\u201d is rendered by the standard German compound \u201cWeidezaun.\u201d  \n- The three elements are joined into the natural German compound noun \u201cFischerbach-Weidezaunprojekt,\u201d which is introduced by the neuter article \u201cDas\u201d to agree with \u201cProjekt.\u201d  \n- \u201cIs a successful project\u201d translates directly as \u201cist ein erfolgreiches Projekt.\u201d  \n- \u201cWill be continued next year\u201d is expressed by the future passive construction \u201cwird n\u00e4chstes Jahr fortgesetzt.\u201d\n\nThe resulting German sentence therefore reads:\n\nDas Fischerbach-Weidezaunprojekt ist ein erfolgreiches Projekt und wird n\u00e4chstes Jahr fortgesetzt.\n\n\\boxed{Das Fischerbach-Weidezaunprojekt ist ein erfolgreiches Projekt und wird n\u00e4chstes Jahr fortgesetzt.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 167, "output_tokens": 203, "total_tokens": 370}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00071625, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_17", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe resulting smog can cause serious breathing problems among sensitive groups of people, contributing to thousands of premature deaths each year.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The resulting smog can cause serious breathing problems among sensitive groups of people, contributing to thousands of premature deaths each year.\n\nA natural and accurate German translation is:\n\nDer entstehende Smog kann bei empfindlichen Personengruppen ernsthafte Atemprobleme verursachen und tr\u00e4gt so zu Tausenden von vorzeitigen Todesf\u00e4llen pro Jahr bei.\n\nThis rendering preserves the original meaning, uses standard environmental/health terminology in German (e.g., \u201cAtemprobleme,\u201d \u201cempfindliche Personengruppen,\u201d \u201cvorzeitige Todesf\u00e4lle\u201d), and maintains grammatical correctness and fluency.\n\n\\boxed{Der entstehende Smog kann bei empfindl. Personengruppen ernsthafte Atemprobleme verursachen u. tr\u00e4gt so zu Tausenden vorzeit. Todesf\u00e4llen/Jahr bei.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 173, "output_tokens": 168, "total_tokens": 341}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00063625, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_170", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe main character in the film \"Crazy Island\" is a giraffe \u2013 Mordillo's favourite animal in his drawings \u2013 who has a millipede as his nemesis.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence to be translated consists of three main parts that must be rendered accurately while preserving the original meaning, appositive structure (set off by dashes), and reference to the giraffe character:\n\n- \u201cThe main character in the film \u2018Crazy Island\u2019 is a giraffe\u201d becomes \u201cDie Hauptfigur im Film \u201aCrazy Island\u2018 ist eine Giraffe.\u201d\n- The parenthetical description \u201cMordillo\u2019s favourite animal in his drawings\u201d becomes the German appositive \u201c\u2013 Mordillos Lieblingstier in seinen Zeichnungen \u2013.\u201d\n- The relative clause \u201cwho has a millipede as his nemesis\u201d is attached to the feminine noun \u201cGiraffe.\u201d In German the relative pronoun must therefore be feminine (\u201cdie\u201d), and the possessive is adjusted to \u201cihren\u201d; \u201cmillipede\u201d is rendered by the standard zoological term \u201cTausendf\u00fc\u00dfler\u201d and \u201cnemesis\u201d by the natural equivalent \u201cWidersacher.\u201d\n\nCombining these elements yields a grammatically correct, fluent German sentence that keeps the original word order and stylistic features (including the dashes and the film title in quotation marks).\n\n\\boxed{Die Hauptfigur im Film \"Crazy Island\" ist eine Giraffe \u2013 Mordillos Lieblingstier in seinen Zeichnungen \u2013, die einen Tausendf\u00fc\u00dfler als ihren Widersacher hat.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 185, "output_tokens": 267, "total_tokens": 452}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00089875, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_171", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe construction of the four wind turbines should cover the energy requirements of around 11,400 households \u2013 that equates to around a fifth of the energy requirements of all Viersen households.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Der Bau der vier Windkraftanlagen soll den Energiebedarf von rund 11.400 Haushalten decken \u2013 das entspricht etwa einem F\u00fcnftel des Energiebedarfs aller Viersener Haushalte.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Der Bau der vier Windkraftanlagen soll den Energiebedarf von rund 11.400 Haushalten decken \u2013 das entspricht etwa einem F\u00fcnftel des Energiebedarfs aller Viersener Haushalte.}}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 69, "output_tokens": 115, "total_tokens": 184}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.6399e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_224", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nUp until 1869, the Hilarius cemetery in Tumlingen served as the last place of rest for H\u00f6rschweiler's dead.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{Bis 1869 diente der Hilarius-Friedhof in Tumlingen als letzte Ruhest\u00e4tte der Verstorbenen aus H\u00f6rschweiler.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 60, "output_tokens": 43, "total_tokens": 103}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 8.56e-06, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_236", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe world's largest and most profitable gold mine, Grasberg, owned by Phoenix-based Freeport McMoran, lies just 60 miles from Paniai, a highland province around the size of New Jersey and home to 153,000 people.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Die weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dfte und profitabelste Goldmine, Grasberg, die der in Phoenix ans\u00e4ssigen Firma Freeport McMoran geh\u00f6rt, liegt nur 60 Meilen von Paniai entfernt, einer Hochlandprovinz von der Gr\u00f6\u00dfe New Jerseys mit 153.000 Einwohnern.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Die weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dfte und profitabelste Goldmine, Grasberg, die der in Phoenix ans\u00e4ssigen Firma Freeport McMoran geh\u00f6rt, liegt nur 60 Meilen von Paniai entfernt, einer Hochlandprovinz von der Gr\u00f6\u00dfe New Jerseys mit 153.000 Einwohnern.}}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 86, "output_tokens": 151, "total_tokens": 237}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 2.1206000000000003e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_247", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe world football association, FIFA, is organising the first \"Interactive Club World Cup\" this coming weekend in London, which will see gamers from different clubs compete against each other.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence is translated accurately into German as follows, preserving proper names, technical terms, and overall meaning while ensuring natural phrasing:\n\n- \"The world football association, FIFA\" becomes \"Der Weltfu\u00dfballverband FIFA\".\n- \"is organising\" is rendered as \"veranstaltet\".\n- The event name in quotes is retained unchanged as a proper noun.\n- \"this coming weekend in London\" is expressed as \"am kommenden Wochenende in London\".\n- The relative clause \"which will see gamers from different clubs compete against each other\" is translated as \"bei dem Gamer verschiedener Clubs gegeneinander antreten werden\", using \"Gamer\" and \"Clubs\" (common in German esports contexts) and \"Vereinen\" for football clubs where appropriate.\n\nThe resulting full translation is:  \n\"Der Weltfu\u00dfballverband FIFA veranstaltet am kommenden Wochenende in London den ersten \u201eInteractive Club World Cup\u201c, bei dem Gamer verschiedener Clubs gegeneinander antreten werden.\"\n\n\\boxed{Der Weltfu\u00dfballverb. FIFA veranstaltet am komm. Wochenende in London den ersten \u201eInteractive Club World Cup\u201c, bei dem Gamer versch. Clubs gegeneinander antreten.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 185, "output_tokens": 241, "total_tokens": 426}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00083375, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_266", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe trade-off from no two-a-days is more one-a-days, the Bruins pushing up the start of camp nearly a week from last season and holding practices during summer school for the first time during Mora's six seasons in Westwood.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence concerns American football training practices (with \"two-a-days\" referring to two sessions per day and \"one-a-days\" to one session per day). A natural German rendering that preserves the original meaning, sports terminology, and sentence structure is therefore:\n\n\"Der Verzicht auf Zwei-Einheiten-Tage wird durch mehr Ein-Einheiten-Tage ausgeglichen, wobei die Bruins den Beginn des Camps im Vergleich zur letzten Saison um fast eine Woche vorverlegen und zum ersten Mal w\u00e4hrend Moras sechs Saisons in Westwood Trainingseinheiten w\u00e4hrend der Summer School abhalten.\"\n\n\\boxed{Der Verzicht auf Zwei-Einheiten-Tage wird durch mehr Ein-Einheiten-Tage ausgeglichen, wobei die Bruins den Beginn des Camps im Vergleich zur letzten Saison um fast eine Woche vorverlegen und zum ersten Mal w\u00e4hrend Moras sechs Saisons in Westwood Trainingseinheiten w\u00e4hrend der Summer School abhalten.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 258, "output_tokens": 829, "total_tokens": 1087}, "provider": "xAI", "model_used": "x-ai/grok-4.3", "requested_model": "x-ai/grok-4.3", "invoked_at": "2026-08-05T16:36:06.638075+00:00"}, "cost": 0.002395, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_289", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nAs the cultural establishment announced on Thursday, singers Gloria Estefan (59) and Lionel Richie (68), as well as choreographer Carmen de Lavallade (86) and the TV producer Norman Lear (95) are also among those being honoured.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Wie die kulturelle Institution am Donnerstag bekanntgab, geh\u00f6ren zu den Geehrten unter anderem die S\u00e4nger Gloria Estefan (59) und Lionel Richie (68) sowie die Choreografin Carmen de Lavallade (86) und der Fernsehproduzent Norman Lear (95).\n\n\\boxed{{Wie die kulturelle Institution am Donnerstag bekanntgab, geh\u00f6ren zu den Geehrten unter anderem die S\u00e4nger Gloria Estefan (59) und Lionel Richie (68) sowie die Choreografin Carmen de Lavallade (86) und der Fernsehproduzent Norman Lear (95).}}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 83, "output_tokens": 141, "total_tokens": 224}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.9993000000000003e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_294", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThis long tail of Antarctica stretches towards South America.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence describes a geographical feature (the Antarctic Peninsula) in somewhat figurative terms. A direct but natural translation into German is therefore required, preserving both the literal wording and the intended meaning:\n\n- \u201cThis long tail\u201d becomes \u201cDieser lange Schwanz\u201d (retaining the slightly metaphorical \u201ctail\u201d rather than substituting the more technical \u201cHalbinsel\u201d or \u201cAusl\u00e4ufer\u201d).  \n- \u201cof Antarctica\u201d is rendered as the standard genitive \u201cder Antarktis.\u201d  \n- \u201cstretches towards\u201d is expressed by the common verb \u201cerstreckt sich \u2026 bis nach,\u201d which conveys extension in a geographic sense.  \n- \u201cSouth America\u201d is the conventional proper name \u201cS\u00fcdamerika.\u201d\n\nPutting these elements together yields the fluent German sentence \u201cDieser lange Schwanz der Antarktis erstreckt sich bis nach S\u00fcdamerika.\u201d\n\n\\boxed{Dieser lange Schwanz der Antarktis erstreckt sich bis nach S\u00fcdamerika.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 160, "output_tokens": 195, "total_tokens": 355}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.0006875, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_301", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nAccording to that information, ten million people with foreign nationality are recorded in the register, among whom around 5.7 million from non-EU states.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{Nach diesen Angaben sind zehn Millionen Menschen mit ausl\u00e4ndischer Staatsangeh\u00f6rigkeit im Register erfasst, darunter rund 5,7 Millionen aus Nicht-EU-Staaten.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 59, "output_tokens": 47, "total_tokens": 106}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 8.888999999999999e-06, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_310", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nSwiss introduced the possibility of inserting a logo two and a half years ago, at the start of the collaboration with Chocolat Frey.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence to be translated is:  \n\u201cSwiss introduced the possibility of inserting a logo two and a half years ago, at the start of the collaboration with Chocolat Frey.\u201d\n\nA direct, idiomatic rendering into German proceeds as follows:\n\n- \u201cSwiss\u201d is retained as the proper name of the airline.  \n- \u201cintroduced \u2026 the possibility\u201d becomes the separable verb construction \u201cf\u00fchrte \u2026 die M\u00f6glichkeit ein\u201d.  \n- \u201cof inserting a logo\u201d is rendered by the infinitive phrase \u201cein Logo einzuf\u00fcgen\u201d.  \n- The temporal adverbial \u201ctwo and a half years ago\u201d is expressed by the standard German phrase \u201cvor zweieinhalb Jahren\u201d.  \n- The prepositional phrase \u201cat the start of the collaboration with Chocolat Frey\u201d is translated literally as \u201czu Beginn der Zusammenarbeit mit Chocolat Frey\u201d.\n\nReordering the constituents for natural German word order yields the compact sentence  \n\nSwiss f\u00fchrte die M\u00f6glichkeit, ein Logo einzuf\u00fcgen, vor zweieinhalb Jahren ein, zu Beginn der Zusammenarbeit mit Chocolat Frey.\n\nThis version preserves the original meaning, maintains grammatical correctness, and reads fluently in German.\n\n\\boxed{Swiss f\u00fchrte die M\u00f6glichkeit, ein Logo einzuf\u00fcgen, vor zweieinhalb Jahren ein, zu Beginn der Zusammenarbeit mit Chocolat Frey.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 177, "output_tokens": 270, "total_tokens": 447}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00089625, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_369", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThey used the collateral to buy the Collingwood property where Colin opened the family's first jeans store.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence describes a financial transaction involving collateral (in the sense of loan security) and a subsequent business opening. The accurate German rendering is therefore:\n\nSie nutzten die Sicherheiten, um das Collingwood-Grundst\u00fcck zu kaufen, wo Colin den ersten Jeansladen der Familie er\u00f6ffnete.\n\nProper names (\u201cCollingwood\u201d, \u201cColin\u201d) remain unchanged, \u201ccollateral\u201d is rendered by the standard financial term \u201cSicherheiten\u201d, and the relative clause is kept concise and idiomatic.\n\n\\boxed{Sie nutzten d. Sicherheiten, um d. Collingwood-Grundst\u00fcck zu kaufen, wo Colin d. ersten Jeansladen d. Familie er\u00f6ffnete.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 170, "output_tokens": 138, "total_tokens": 308}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.0005575, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_377", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe report in the journal Current Biology described it as 'the best-preserved armored dinosaur ever found, and one of the best dinosaur specimens in the world.'\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence to be translated consists of a main clause followed by a direct quotation. The main clause is rendered as \u201cDer Bericht in der Zeitschrift Current Biology beschrieb es als \u2026\u201d, preserving the original subject\u2013verb\u2013object structure and rendering \u201cjournal\u201d by the conventional German term \u201cZeitschrift\u201d for a scientific periodical.  \n\nInside the quotation the predicate adjective \u201cbest-preserved\u201d becomes the superlative phrase \u201cam besten erhaltenen\u201d, placed in the accusative because it modifies the masculine noun \u201cDinosaurier\u201d after \u201cals\u201d. The noun phrase \u201carmored dinosaur\u201d is translated literally as \u201cgepanzerter Dinosaurier\u201d. The participial clause \u201cever found\u201d is expressed by the relative clause \u201cder jemals gefunden wurde\u201d.  \n\nThe coordinate clause \u201cone of the best dinosaur specimens in the world\u201d is rendered \u201ceines der besten Dinosaurier-Exemplare der Welt\u201d, employing the partitive genitive construction standard in German.  \n\nThe resulting German sentence therefore reads:  \n\nDer Bericht in der Zeitschrift Current Biology beschrieb es als \u201eden am besten erhaltenen gepanzerten Dinosaurier, der jemals gefunden wurde, und eines der besten Dinosaurier-Exemplare der Welt.\u201c\n\n\\boxed{Der Bericht in der Zeitschrift Current Biology beschrieb es als \u201eden am besten erhaltenen gepanzerten Dinosaurier, der jemals gefunden wurde, und eines der besten Dinosaurier-Exemplare der Welt.\u201c}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 181, "output_tokens": 290, "total_tokens": 471}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00095125, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_379", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nBy algorithmically analyzing DNA extracted from Manning and using it to create 30 portraits of what someone with that genomic data might look like, Dewey-Hagborg has created a trenchant, if somewhat cerebral, commentary on not only the malleability of DNA data - the many ways it can be interpreted, and the inherent determinism of those interpretations - but also identity.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{Indem sie algorithmisch DNA analysierte, die aus Manning gewonnen wurde, und daraus 30 Portr\u00e4ts davon erstellte, wie jemand mit diesen genomischen Daten aussehen k\u00f6nnte, hat Dewey-Hagborg eine pr\u00e4gnante, wenn auch etwas intellektuelle Auseinandersetzung geschaffen, die nicht nur die Ver\u00e4nderbarkeit von DNA-Daten thematisiert \u2013 die zahlreichen M\u00f6glichkeiten ihrer Interpretation und den inh\u00e4renten Determinismus dieser Interpretationen \u2013, sondern auch die Identit\u00e4t insgesamt.}}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 104, "output_tokens": 122, "total_tokens": 226}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.9584e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_381", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe first tour led along the vineyards, amidst hot summer temperatures, to the Chapel of St. Michael above Deidesheim.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence describes a route taken on an initial tour, passing vineyards under hot summer conditions and ending at a specific chapel. A natural German rendering preserves this structure and flow while using idiomatic phrasing:\n\n- \u201cThe first tour led\u201d becomes \u201cDie erste Tour f\u00fchrte\u201d.  \n- \u201cAlong the vineyards\u201d is rendered \u201centlang der Weinberge\u201d.  \n- \u201cAmidst hot summer temperatures\u201d is idiomatically expressed as \u201cbei hei\u00dfen Sommertemperaturen\u201d.  \n- \u201cTo the Chapel of St. Michael above Deidesheim\u201d translates directly to \u201czur Kapelle St. Michael oberhalb von Deidesheim\u201d.\n\nCombining these elements yields the fluent translation \u201cDie erste Tour f\u00fchrte entlang der Weinberge bei hei\u00dfen Sommertemperaturen zur Kapelle St. Michael oberhalb von Deidesheim.\u201d\n\n\\boxed{Die erste Tour f\u00fchrte entlang der Weinberge bei hei\u00dfen Sommertemperaturen zur Kapelle St. Michael oberhalb von Deidesheim.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 175, "output_tokens": 191, "total_tokens": 366}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00069625, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_393", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nWarren is a senior treasury assistant at Oxford University.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence to be translated is \"Warren is a senior treasury assistant at Oxford University.\"\n\n- \"Warren\" is a proper name and remains unchanged.\n- \"Senior\" in a professional title is rendered as the German equivalent \"leitender\" (denoting a higher-ranking role).\n- \"Treasury assistant\" refers to a finance-related support role; the natural German rendering is therefore \"Finanzassistent.\"\n- \"Oxford University\" follows standard German usage as \"Universit\u00e4t Oxford.\"\n\nCombining these elements yields the fluent, idiomatic translation  \nWarren ist leitender Finanzassistent an der Universit\u00e4t Oxford.\n\n\\boxed{Warren ist leitender Finanzassistent an der Uni Oxford.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 160, "output_tokens": 137, "total_tokens": 297}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.0005425, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_404", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\n\"According to our estimations, 167 lung cancer deaths a year can be attributed to passive smoking,\" said study leader Heiko Becher.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\u201eLaut unseren Sch\u00e4tzungen k\u00f6nnen j\u00e4hrlich 167 Lungenkrebstote auf das Passivrauchen zur\u00fcckgef\u00fchrt werden\u201c, sagte Studienleiter Heiko Becher.\n\n\\boxed{\u201eLaut unseren Sch\u00e4tzungen k\u00f6nnen j\u00e4hrlich 167 Lungenkrebstote auf das Passivrauchen zur\u00fcckgef\u00fchrt werden\u201c, sagte Studienleiter Heiko Becher.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 59, "output_tokens": 84, "total_tokens": 143}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.2589000000000001e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_42", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\n\"The White House is thrilled with the 'Made In America' showcase that featured products from all 50 states that are made by American workers with American materials,\" said White House deputy press secretary Lindsay Walters.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\u201eDas Wei\u00dfe Haus freut sich sehr \u00fcber die \u201aMade In America\u2018-Pr\u00e4sentation, bei der Produkte aus allen 50 Bundesstaaten gezeigt wurden, die von amerikanischen Arbeitnehmern mit amerikanischen Materialien hergestellt wurden\u201c, sagte die stellvertretende Pressesprecherin des Wei\u00dfen Hauses, Lindsay Walters.\n\n\\boxed{{\u201eDas Wei\u00dfe Haus freut sich sehr \u00fcber die \u201aMade In America\u2018-Pr\u00e4sentation, bei der Produkte aus allen 50 Bundesstaaten gezeigt wurden, die von amerikanischen Arbeitnehmern mit amerikanischen Materialien hergestellt wurden\u201c, sagte die stellvertretende Pressesprecherin des Wei\u00dfen Hauses, Lindsay Walters.}}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 69, "output_tokens": 161, "total_tokens": 230}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 2.0999000000000003e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_44", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe chair of the Loudoun County Board of Supervisors violated the First Amendment, according to U.S. District Judge James C. Cacheris in Alexandria, when she banned a constituent from her Facebook page.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence must be translated accurately while preserving proper names, legal terminology, and the original meaning and structure. \u201cChair\u201d is rendered in the feminine form (\u201cVorsitzende\u201d) to match the pronoun \u201cshe.\u201d \u201cBoard of Supervisors\u201d is retained as an official title. \u201cFirst Amendment\u201d is conventionally expressed in German legal usage as \u201cersten Verfassungszusatz.\u201d \u201cConstituent\u201d is translated as \u201cB\u00fcrgerin ihres Wahlbezirks\u201d to convey the political relationship. The clause order and attribution (\u201caccording to \u2026\u201d) are maintained for fidelity.\n\nThe resulting translation is therefore:\n\nDie Vorsitzende des Loudoun County Board of Supervisors verstie\u00df gegen den ersten Verfassungszusatz, so US-Bezirksrichter James C. Cacheris in Alexandria, als sie eine B\u00fcrgerin ihres Wahlbezirks von ihrer Facebook-Seite ausschloss.\n\n\\boxed{Die Vorsitzende des Loudoun County Board of Supervisors verstie\u00df gg. den 1. Verfassungszusatz, so US-Bezirksrichter James C. Cacheris in Alexandria, als sie eine B\u00fcrgerin ihres Wahlbezirks von ihrer FB-Seite ausschloss.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 191, "output_tokens": 247, "total_tokens": 438}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00085625, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_447", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\n\"I moved up for Broner [at 140 pounds], but I'm not that big.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{Ich bin f\u00fcr Broner [bei 140 Pfund] aufgestiegen, aber ich bin nicht so gro\u00df.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 49, "output_tokens": 30, "total_tokens": 79}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 6.478999999999999e-06, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_46", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe travel warning is also a response to a new Missouri law that would make it more difficult to sue a business for housing or employment discrimination.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence is translated by rendering each segment into natural, idiomatic German while preserving the original meaning, legal terminology, and sentence structure:\n\n- \u201cThe travel warning\u201d becomes the standard German collocation \u201cDie Reisewarnung.\u201d  \n- \u201cis also a response to\u201d is rendered as \u201cist auch eine Reaktion auf,\u201d which is the conventional journalistic phrasing.  \n- \u201ca new Missouri law\u201d is expressed as \u201cein neues Gesetz in Missouri\u201d for fluency.  \n- The relative clause \u201cthat would make it more difficult to sue a business for housing or employment discrimination\u201d is translated with the subjunctive \u201cw\u00fcrde \u2026 machen\u201d to reflect the conditional sense, using the established legal terms \u201cDiskriminierung bei der Wohnungssuche oder Besch\u00e4ftigung.\u201d\n\nThe resulting translation is therefore:\n\nDie Reisewarnung ist auch eine Reaktion auf ein neues Gesetz in Missouri, das es schwieriger machen w\u00fcrde, ein Unternehmen wegen Diskriminierung bei der Wohnungssuche oder Besch\u00e4ftigung zu verklagen.\n\n\\boxed{Die Reisewarnung ist auch eine Reaktion auf ein neues Gesetz in Missouri, das es schwieriger machen w\u00fcrde, ein Unternehmen wegen Diskriminierung bei der Wohnungssuche oder Besch\u00e4ftigung zu verklagen.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 178, "output_tokens": 258, "total_tokens": 436}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.0008675, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_469", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nMichelle Carter sentenced for texts urging suicide of Conrad Roy\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence to be translated is the English headline \"Michelle Carter sentenced for texts urging suicide of Conrad Roy\".  \n\n- Proper names (\"Michelle Carter\", \"Conrad Roy\") remain unchanged.  \n- \"Sentenced\" is rendered by the concise headline-style verb \"verurteilt\".  \n- \"For texts\" becomes the prepositional phrase \"wegen Texten\", which is the natural legal/headline collocation in German.  \n- \"Urging suicide\" is expressed by the participial clause \"die zum Suizid dr\u00e4ngten\", preserving both the meaning of \"urging/encouraging\" and the compact headline register.  \n- The genitive \"of Conrad Roy\" is translated directly as \"von Conrad Roy\".  \n\nCombining these elements yields the fluent German headline  \n\nMichelle Carter wegen Texten verurteilt, die zum Suizid von Conrad Roy dr\u00e4ngten.\n\n\\boxed{Michelle Carter wg. Texten verurteilt, die zum Suizid v. Conrad Roy dr\u00e4ngten}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 161, "output_tokens": 204, "total_tokens": 365}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00071125, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_493", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe green-and-white Sikorsky VH-3D, known as Marine One when the President is aboard, was the centerpiece of the July 17 event at the White House showcasing American construction programs.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{Der gr\u00fcn-wei\u00dfe Sikorsky VH-3D, der mit Pr\u00e4sident an Bord als Marine One bekannt ist, stand im Mittelpunkt der Veranstaltung am 17. Juli im Wei\u00dfen Haus, die amerikanische Bauprojekte pr\u00e4sentierte.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 69, "output_tokens": 64, "total_tokens": 133}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.1299e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_5", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nAs the company points out, however, the TSA guidelines are somewhat complicated and confusing.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Wie das Unternehmen jedoch betont, sind die TSA-Richtlinien etwas kompliziert und verwirrend.\n\nThe translation preserves the original sentence structure and meaning as closely as possible. \u201cAs the company points out\u201d is rendered with the common German construction \u201cWie das Unternehmen \u2026 betont,\u201d the concessive \u201chowever\u201d is placed naturally as \u201cjedoch,\u201d \u201cTSA guidelines\u201d remains an established acronym-plus-noun phrase (TSA-Richtlinien), and \u201csomewhat complicated and confusing\u201d is translated directly with \u201cetwas kompliziert und verwirrend.\u201d The result is idiomatic, grammatically correct German that conveys the same nuance and emphasis as the English source.\n\n\\boxed{Wie das Unternehmen jedoch betont, sind die TSA-Richtlinien etwas kompliziert u. verwirrend.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 167, "output_tokens": 171, "total_tokens": 338}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00063625, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_515", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nIn addition, Papua boasts timber resources worth an estimated $78 billion.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Au\u00dferdem verf\u00fcgt Papua \u00fcber Holzressourcen im gesch\u00e4tzten Wert von 78 Milliarden US-Dollar.\n\n\\boxed{Au\u00dferdem verf\u00fcgt Papua \u00fcber Holzressourcen im gesch\u00e4tzten Wert von 78 Milliarden US-Dollar.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 43, "output_tokens": 60, "total_tokens": 103}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 9.053000000000001e-06, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_516", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nOr The Smuggler, which features 18th-century contrabander Arthur Darrell, who is thought to have staged his own funeral by filling a coffin with rocks (a discovery made years later when his coffin was unearthed).\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{Oder Der Schmuggler, der den Schmuggler Arthur Darrell aus dem 18. Jahrhundert zeigt, von dem man annimmt, er habe seine eigene Beerdigung inszeniert, indem er einen Sarg mit Steinen f\u00fcllte (eine Entdeckung, die Jahre sp\u00e4ter gemacht wurde, als sein Sarg ausgegraben wurde).}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 76, "output_tokens": 87, "total_tokens": 163}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.4096e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_542", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe AfD event lasts a little more than an hour; the guests in the forecourt have a long wind, but even there it is time to clear up shortly after 9pm.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Die AfD-Veranstaltung dauert etwas \u00fcber eine Stunde; die G\u00e4ste auf dem Vorplatz haben viel zu sagen, doch auch dort ist es kurz nach 21 Uhr Zeit, sich zu zerstreuen.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Die AfD-Veranstaltung dauert etwas \u00fcber eine Stunde; die G\u00e4ste auf dem Vorplatz haben viel zu sagen, doch auch dort ist es kurz nach 21 Uhr Zeit, sich zu zerstreuen.}}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 66, "output_tokens": 97, "total_tokens": 163}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.4386e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_550", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe first stop when they arrived in Ferguson was on South Florissant Road, a site across from the police department that became a campground of sorts as the activists awaited word of Officer Darren Wilson's eventual non-indictment.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence must be translated accurately while preserving its original meaning, structure, and nuance. Key elements include:\n- Rendering \u201cfirst stop\u201d naturally as \u201cerster Halt.\u201d\n- Keeping the proper name \u201cSouth Florissant Road\u201d unchanged.\n- Translating \u201csite across from the police department\u201d as \u201cOrt gegen\u00fcber dem Polizeirevier.\u201d\n- Capturing the informal qualifier \u201ccampground of sorts\u201d with \u201ceine Art Campingplatz.\u201d\n- Expressing the temporal clause \u201cas the activists awaited word of \u2026 eventual non-indictment\u201d idiomatically, using \u201cw\u00e4hrend die Aktivisten auf Nachricht \u2026 warteten\u201d and rendering \u201cnon-indictment\u201d as \u201cNichtanklage.\u201d\n\nCombining these yields the fluent German rendering below.\n\n\\boxed{Der erste Halt, als sie in Ferguson ankamen, war auf der South Florissant Road, einem Ort gegen\u00fcber dem Polizeirevier, der zu einer Art Campingplatz wurde, w\u00e4hrend die Aktivisten auf Nachricht von Officer Darren Wilsons letztendlicher Nichtanklage warteten.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 193, "output_tokens": 210, "total_tokens": 403}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00076625, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_552", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nOrr and former Ryder Cup captain Sam Torrance are among six Scots in the field, the others being Andrew Oldcorn, Stephen McAllister, Bill Longmuir and Ross Drummond.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Orr und der ehemalige Ryder-Cup-Kapit\u00e4n Sam Torrance geh\u00f6ren zu den sechs Schotten im Teilnehmerfeld; die anderen sind Andrew Oldcorn, Stephen McAllister, Bill Longmuir und Ross Drummond.\n\n\\boxed{Orr u. ehem. Ryder-Cup-Kpt. Sam Torrance geh\u00f6ren zu den 6 Schotten im Feld, die anderen sind A. Oldcorn, S. McAllister, B. Longmuir u. R. Drummond.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 187, "output_tokens": 100, "total_tokens": 287}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00048375, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_555", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nLathem has been an associate professor of microbiology and immunology at Northwestern University since 2007.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Lathem ist seit 2007 au\u00dferordentlicher Professor f\u00fcr Mikrobiologie und Immunologie an der Northwestern University.\n\n\\boxed{Lathem\\ ist\\ seit\\ 2007\\ au\u00dferordentlicher\\ Professor\\ f\u00fcr\\ Mikrobiologie\\ und\\ Immunologie\\ an\\ der\\ Northwestern\\ University.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 52, "output_tokens": 76, "total_tokens": 128}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.1292e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_575", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nJavanese warung canteens sell fried chicken and gado-gado mixed-vegetables served with peanut sauce.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence to be translated is:  \n\u201cJavanese warung canteens sell fried chicken and gado-gado mixed-vegetables served with peanut sauce.\u201d\n\n- \u201cJavanese\u201d becomes the adjective \u201cjavanische\u201d.  \n- \u201cWarung canteens\u201d is rendered as the compound \u201cWarung-Kantinen\u201d, preserving the Indonesian loan-word \u201cWarung\u201d (commonly left untranslated in German) while adding the clarifying noun \u201cKantinen\u201d.  \n- \u201cSell\u201d is the present-tense verb \u201cverkaufen\u201d.  \n- \u201cFried chicken\u201d is expressed by the standard culinary term \u201cfrittiertes H\u00e4hnchen\u201d.  \n- \u201cGado-gado mixed-vegetables served with peanut sauce\u201d is kept as the proper name \u201cGado-Gado\u201d followed by the appositive explanation \u201cgemischtes Gem\u00fcse serviert mit Erdnusssauce\u201d, reflecting the dish\u2019s composition.  \n\nPutting the elements together yields the grammatically correct and semantically faithful German sentence:  \n\u201cJavanische Warung-Kantinen verkaufen frittiertes H\u00e4hnchen und Gado-Gado, gemischtes Gem\u00fcse serviert mit Erdnusssauce.\u201d\n\n\\boxed{Javanische Warung-Kantinen verkaufen frittiertes H\u00e4hnchen u. Gado-Gado (gem. Gem\u00fcse m. Erdnusssauce).}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 175, "output_tokens": 281, "total_tokens": 456}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00092125, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_589", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nAntarctica: Gigantic iceberg drifts into the Antarctic\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{Antarktis: Gigantischer Eisberg treibt in die Antarktis}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 41, "output_tokens": 23, "total_tokens": 64}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 5.211000000000001e-06, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_597", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nJoining the trio in the field are former Masters winner Ian Woosnam and Senior major champions Paul Broadhurst, Roger Chapman, Mark James and Mark McNulty.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence describes golfers joining a tournament field and must be rendered in natural German while preserving the inverted structure, golf terminology, and list format.  \n\n- Begin with the prepositional phrase \u201cZum Trio im Feld\u201d to mirror the original fronted element.  \n- Use the idiomatic verb \u201csto\u00dfen \u2026 zu\u201d (or the near-synonym \u201cgesellen sich \u2026 zu\u201d) to convey \u201cjoining.\u201d  \n- Translate \u201cformer Masters winner\u201d as \u201cehemalige Masters-Sieger,\u201d keeping the proper noun \u201cMasters\u201d unchanged.  \n- Render \u201cSenior major champions\u201d as the compact compound \u201cSenior-Major-Champions,\u201d a conventional term in German golf reporting.  \n- Retain all personal names exactly as given and apply standard German list punctuation (commas plus a final \u201cund\u201d).  \n\nThe resulting sentence therefore reads:  \nZum Trio im Feld sto\u00dfen der ehemalige Masters-Sieger Ian Woosnam und die Senior-Major-Champions Paul Broadhurst\u3001Roger Chapman\u3001Mark James und Mark McNulty.\n\n\\boxed{Zum Trio im Feld sto\u00dfen der ehem. Masters-Sieger Ian Woosnam u. die Senior-Major-Champions Paul Broadhurst, Roger Chapman, Mark James u. Mark McNulty.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 184, "output_tokens": 258, "total_tokens": 442}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.000875, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_602", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nIt is not Rhodes's first book based on an archive: he also wrote 2014's Dead Men's Teeth and Other Stories, a collection inspired by documents in the British Library - a project he found unexpectedly emotional.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Es ist nicht das erste Buch von Rhodes, das auf einem Archiv basiert: Er schrieb auch 2014 Dead Men's Teeth and Other Stories, eine Sammlung, die von Dokumenten in der British Library inspiriert wurde \u2013 ein Projekt, das er \u00fcberraschend emotional fand.\n\n\\boxed{Es ist nicht das erste Buch von Rhodes, das auf einem Archiv basiert: Er schrieb auch 2014 Dead Men's Teeth and Other Stories, eine Sammlung, die von Dokumenten in der British Library inspiriert wurde \u2013 ein Projekt, das er \u00fcberraschend emotional fand.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 74, "output_tokens": 137, "total_tokens": 211}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.8954000000000002e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_614", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nAccording to information from the Bavarian Surveying and Mapping Authority, these came into being between 1810 and 1864 and arise out of the first survey of Bavaria.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Laut Angaben der bayerischen Vermessungs- und Katasterverwaltung entstanden diese zwischen 1810 und 1864 und gehen auf die erste Vermessung Bayerns zur\u00fcck.\n\n\\boxed{Laut Angaben der bayerischen Vermessungs- und Katasterverwaltung entstanden diese zwischen 1810 und 1864 und gehen auf die erste Vermessung Bayerns zur\u00fcck.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 68, "output_tokens": 95, "total_tokens": 163}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.4327999999999999e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_623", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe latter said on Thursday it regarded the new rules as unnecessary but acceptable as they would not involve any \"significant change or impediment\" to its rescue operations.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence refers to an entity previously mentioned in context (likely an organization), which can be rendered in German as \u201cLetzterer\u201d (masculine) or \u201cLetztere\u201d (feminine/neuter) depending on the antecedent; the remainder of the translation is gender-neutral.  \n\nA natural, idiomatic rendering is obtained by:  \n- keeping the reporting verb in the Konjunjunktiv I (\u201csagte \u2026 er betrachte \u2026\u201d) to preserve indirect speech,  \n- rendering \u201cregarded \u2026 as\u201d with the standard collocation \u201cbetrachtete \u2026 als\u201d,  \n- translating the quoted phrase literally while preserving the original quotation marks, and  \n- choosing the conventional German term \u201cRettungseins\u00e4tze\u201d for \u201crescue operations.\u201d  \n\nThe resulting translation therefore reads:  \nLetzterer sagte am Donnerstag, er betrachte die neuen Regeln als unn\u00f6tig, aber akzeptabel, da sie keine \u201esignifikante \u00c4nderung oder Behinderung\u201c seiner Rettungseins\u00e4tze mit sich bringen w\u00fcrden.\n\n\\boxed{Letzterer sagte am Donnerstag, er betrachte die neuen Regeln als unn\u00f6tig, aber akzeptabel, da sie keine \u201esignifikante \u00c4nderung oder Behinderung\u201c seiner Rettungseins\u00e4tze mit sich bringen w\u00fcrden.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 181, "output_tokens": 269, "total_tokens": 450}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00089875, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_634", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nAffected eggs should be destroyed or returned.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence \"Affected eggs should be destroyed or returned\" is a straightforward declarative statement, likely from a product-safety or recall context.  \n\n- \"Affected\" translates directly as the adjective *betroffene* (agreeing in gender and number with the plural noun *Eier*).  \n- \"Eggs\" is simply *Eier*.  \n- The modal construction \"should be \u2026\" is rendered by the German modal *sollten* followed by a passive infinitive.  \n- \"Destroyed\" is expressed by the verb *vernichten* (commonly used for contaminated or unsafe goods).  \n- \"Returned\" is rendered by *zur\u00fcckgegeben* (the standard participle for returning merchandise).  \n\nCombining these elements yields the grammatically correct and stylistically natural German sentence  \n\nBetroffene Eier sollten vernichtet oder zur\u00fcckgegeben werden.\n\n\\boxed{Betroffene Eier sollten vernichtet oder zur\u00fcckgegeben werden.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 158, "output_tokens": 188, "total_tokens": 346}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.0006675, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_692", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nBut, pointedly, when it comes to their \"personalities\" the robots do not represent real women.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence to be translated is:  \n\"But, pointedly, when it comes to their 'personalities' the robots do not represent real women.\"\n\nA direct, context-preserving rendering into German begins with the adversative conjunction \"Aber\" (corresponding to \"But\"). The adverb \"pointedly\" is rendered by the cognate \"pointiert\", which retains the original nuance of a deliberately sharp or emphatic observation and occupies the same syntactic slot immediately after the comma.  \n\nThe subordinate clause \"when it comes to their 'personalities'\" is translated literally as \"wenn es um ihre 'Pers\u00f6nlichkeiten' geht\", preserving both the idiomatic English construction and the quotation marks around \"personalities\".  \n\nThe main clause \"the robots do not represent real women\" becomes \"repr\u00e4sentieren die Roboter keine realen Frauen\", using the verb \"repr\u00e4sentieren\" for \"represent\" and the adjective \"realen\" for \"real\".  \n\nCombining these elements yields the grammatically well-formed and stylistically faithful translation:  \n\"Aber, pointiert, wenn es um ihre 'Pers\u00f6nlichkeiten' geht, repr\u00e4sentieren die Roboter keine realen Frauen.\"\n\n\\boxed{Aber, pointiert, wenn es um ihre \"Pers\u00f6nlichkeiten\" geht, repr\u00e4sentieren die Roboter keine realen Frauen.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 172, "output_tokens": 269, "total_tokens": 441}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.0008875, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_708", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nIn addition, they will learn why stars have different colours, or why one star shines more brightly than another, although it is significantly further away.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence to be translated is:\n\n\"In addition, they will learn why stars have different colours, or why one star shines more brightly than another, although it is significantly further away.\"\n\nA direct and natural German rendering begins with an equivalent discourse marker for \"In addition\" (\"Au\u00dferdem\" or \"Dar\u00fcber hinaus\"). The future-tense verb phrase \"they will learn\" is rendered as \"werden sie lernen\".  \n\nThe two coordinated indirect questions are kept parallel:  \n- \"why stars have different colours\" \u2192 \"warum Sterne unterschiedliche Farben haben\",  \n- \"why one star shines more brightly than another\" \u2192 \"warum ein Stern heller leuchtet als ein anderer\".  \n\nThe concessive clause \"although it is significantly further away\" refers to the more distant star (masculine in German), yielding \"obwohl er sich deutlich weiter entfernt befindet\".  \n\nPutting these elements together produces the fluent translation  \n\n\"Dar\u00fcber hinaus werden sie lernen, warum Sterne unterschiedliche Farben haben oder warum ein Stern heller leuchtet als ein anderer, obwohl er sich deutlich weiter entfernt befindet.\"\n\n\\boxed{Au\u00dferdem werden sie lernen, warum Sterne unterschiedliche Farben haben oder warum ein Stern heller leuchtet als ein anderer, obwohl er sich deutlich weiter entfernt befindet.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 179, "output_tokens": 269, "total_tokens": 448}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00089625, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_715", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe start-ups that will help your company avoid becoming the next Uber\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence to be translated is a headline-style phrase whose core meaning is identifying startups that assist companies in sidestepping a negative outcome (i.e., turning into another Uber).  \n\n- \u201cThe start-ups\u201d becomes the German plural \u201cDie Start-ups\u201d (or \u201cDie Startups\u201d), preserving the original spelling convention common in business German.  \n- The relative clause \u201cthat will help your company\u201d is rendered as \u201cdie Ihrem Unternehmen helfen werden,\u201d maintaining future tense and formal address (\u201cIhrem\u201d).  \n- \u201cAvoid becoming the next Uber\u201d is expressed by the infinitive construction \u201cnicht das n\u00e4chste Uber zu werden,\u201d which correctly captures the negation of the transformation.  \n\nCombining these elements yields the compact, natural headline  \n\u201cDie Start-ups, die Ihrem Unternehmen helfen werden, nicht das n\u00e4chste Uber zu werden.\u201d  \n\nThis version is grammatically accurate, stylistically appropriate for a title, and faithful to the source meaning.\n\n\\boxed{Die Start-ups, die Ihrem Unternehmen helfen werden, nicht das n\u00e4chste Uber zu werden}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 164, "output_tokens": 210, "total_tokens": 374}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00073, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_739", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nA study from consultancy firm Deloitte and the Federal Association of Interactive Entertainment Software (BIU) predicts rapid growth for the e-sport.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Eine Studie der Unternehmensberatung Deloitte und des Bundesverbandes Interaktive Unterhaltungssoftware (BIU) sagt dem E-Sport ein rasantes Wachstum voraus.\n\n\\boxed{Eine Studie d. Unternehmensberatung Deloitte u. d. Bundesverbands Interaktive Unterhaltungssoftware (BIU) sagt d. E-Sport rasantes Wachstum voraus.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 176, "output_tokens": 88, "total_tokens": 264}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00044, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_740", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nAnd in Kentucky, Gov. Matt Bevin (R) also got a visit from the ACLU over his use of Facebook and Twitter.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence is translated by rendering each segment naturally while preserving proper names, abbreviations, and political context:\n\n- \u201cAnd in Kentucky\u201d becomes the straightforward \u201cUnd in Kentucky\u201d.\n- \u201cGov. Matt Bevin (R)\u201d is retained essentially unchanged (or lightly expanded to \u201cGouverneur Matt Bevin (R)\u201d) because German news style commonly keeps English titles and party designators.\n- \u201calso got a visit from the ACLU\u201d is expressed as \u201cbekam \u2026 ebenfalls Besuch von der ACLU\u201d, capturing the idiomatic sense of an official visit or delegation.\n- \u201cover his use of Facebook and Twitter\u201d is rendered with the concise causal preposition \u201cwegen\u201d followed by the nominalized phrase \u201cseiner Nutzung von Facebook und Twitter\u201d.\n\nCombining these yields the fluent German sentence  \n\u201cUnd in Kentucky bekam auch Gov. Matt Bevin (R) Besuch von der ACLU wegen seiner Nutzung von Facebook und Twitter.\u201d\n\n\\boxed{Und in Kentucky bekam auch Gov. Matt Bevin (R) Besuch von der ACLU wegen seiner Nutzung von Facebook und Twitter.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 178, "output_tokens": 216, "total_tokens": 394}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.0007625, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_765", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThis would have allowed it to better blend into its surroundings and evade its enemies, experts say, suggesting it was preyed on by larger dinosaurs.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Dies h\u00e4tte es ihm erm\u00f6glicht, sich besser in seiner Umgebung zu tarnen und seinen Feinden zu entgehen, sagen Experten, was darauf hindeutet, dass es von gr\u00f6\u00dferen Dinosauriern gejagt wurde.\n\nThe translation preserves the original sentence structure, including the conditional \"would have allowed\" rendered as \"h\u00e4tte es ihm erm\u00f6glicht,\" the participial phrase \"suggesting\" as \"was darauf hindeutet,\" and context-specific terms such as \"blend into its surroundings\" (sich tarnen) and \"preyed on\" (gejagt wurde). Word order follows standard German conventions for subordinate clauses while remaining faithful to the source meaning.\n\n\\boxed{Dies h\u00e4tte es ihm erm\u00f6glicht, sich besser in seiner Umgebung zu tarnen u. seinen Feinden zu entgehen, sagen Experten, was darauf hindeutet, dass es von gr\u00f6\u00dferen Dinosauriern gejagt wurde.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 179, "output_tokens": 190, "total_tokens": 369}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00069875, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_774", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nMany joined the Free Papua Movement (OPM), the rebel army that claims to defend the rights of the Papuans by launching sporadic attacks and kidnapping raids on Indonesian soldiers.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence must be rendered into natural, idiomatic German while preserving the original meaning, tense, and structure.  \n\n- \u201cMany joined \u2026\u201d becomes \u201cViele schlossen sich \u2026 an\u201d.  \n- The proper name \u201cFree Papua Movement (OPM)\u201d is conventionally rendered in German as \u201cFreien Papua-Bewegung (OPM)\u201d.  \n- \u201cthe rebel army that claims \u2026\u201d is translated as the appositive \u201cder Rebellenarmee, die behauptet \u2026\u201d, keeping the present tense of \u201cclaims\u201d.  \n- \u201cby launching sporadic attacks and kidnapping raids on \u2026\u201d is expressed with the participial construction \u201cindem sie \u2026 durchf\u00fchrt\u201d, using the established compounds \u201csporadische Angriffe\u201d and \u201cEntf\u00fchrungs\u00fcberf\u00e4lle\u201d.  \n\nPutting these elements together yields the following translation:  \n\nViele schlossen sich der Freien Papua-Bewegung (OPM) an, der Rebellenarmee, die behauptet, die Rechte der Papuas zu verteidigen, indem sie sporadische Angriffe und Entf\u00fchrungs\u00fcberf\u00e4lle auf indonesische Soldaten durchf\u00fchrt.\n\n\\boxed{Viele schlossen sich der Freien Papua-Bewegung (OPM) an, der Rebellenarmee, die behauptet, die Rechte der Papuas zu verteidigen, indem sie sporadische Angriffe u. Entf\u00fchrungs\u00fcberf\u00e4lle auf indon. Soldaten durchf\u00fchrt.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 185, "output_tokens": 294, "total_tokens": 479}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00096625, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_776", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nGuillermo Mordillo was born on 4th August 1932 in Buenos Aires, the son of a Spanish immigrant.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{Guillermo Mordillo wurde am 4. August 1932 in Buenos Aires geboren, der Sohn eines spanischen Einwanderers.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 57, "output_tokens": 38, "total_tokens": 95}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 7.847e-06, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_805", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nAcross the room, actors Darrius Bradshaw and Nick Rascona, who play Roger Malcom and Barnett Hester, rehearsed their lines.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Auf der anderen Seite des Raums probten die Schauspieler Darrius Bradshaw und Nick Rascona, die Roger Malcom und Barnett Hester spielen, ihre Texte.\n\n\\boxed{Auf d. anderen Seite d. Raums probten d. Schauspieler Darrius Bradshaw u. Nick Rascona, d. Roger Malcom u. Barnett Hester spielen, ihre Texte.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 177, "output_tokens": 79, "total_tokens": 256}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00041875, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_83", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe cost to automotive companies of installing equipment to neutralize the fumes emitted by diesel vehicles is also increasing, making it difficult to keep the price of the cars competitive.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The cost to automotive companies of installing equipment to neutralize the fumes emitted by diesel vehicles is also increasing, making it difficult to keep the price of the cars competitive.\n\nA natural and accurate German rendering is obtained by preserving the original sentence structure while applying standard German word order, terminology, and nominal style:\n\n- \u201cAutomotive companies\u201d \u2192 \u201cAutomobilunternehmen\u201d (or \u201cAutohersteller\u201d).  \n- \u201cInstalling equipment to neutralize \u2026\u201d is rendered with the nominal construction \u201cdie Installation von Ausr\u00fcstung zur Neutralisierung \u2026\u201d, which is idiomatic in technical German.  \n- \u201cFumes emitted by diesel vehicles\u201d \u2192 \u201cvon Dieselfahrzeugen emittierten Abgase\u201d (the participial attribute keeps the sentence compact).  \n- \u201cIs also increasing\u201d \u2192 \u201csteigen ebenfalls\u201d.  \n- The participial clause \u201cmaking it difficult \u2026\u201d becomes the relative clause \u201cwas es schwierig macht \u2026\u201d, a conventional way to express consequence in German.  \n- \u201cKeep the price of the cars competitive\u201d \u2192 \u201cdie Preise der Autos wettbewerbsf\u00e4hig zu halten\u201d.\n\nPutting these choices together yields the fluent translation\n\nDie Kosten f\u00fcr Automobilunternehmen f\u00fcr die Installation von Ausr\u00fcstung zur Neutralisierung der von Dieselfahrzeugen emittierten Abgase steigen ebenfalls, was es schwierig macht, die Preise der Autos wettbewerbsf\u00e4hig zu halten.\n\n\\boxed{Die Kosten f\u00fcr Automobilunternehmen f\u00fcr die Installation von Ausr\u00fcstung zur Neutralisierung der von Dieselfahrzeugen emittierten Abgase steigen ebenfalls, was es schwierig macht, die Preise der Autos wettbewerbsf\u00e4hig zu halten.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 182, "output_tokens": 351, "total_tokens": 533}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.001105, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_843", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe sculptor Bildhauer Bj\u00f8rn N\u00f8rgaard is already crafting a sarcophagus for the two of them.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The provided English sentence contains a redundancy, as \"Bildhauer\" is simply the German word for \"sculptor.\" This appears to be an appositive or artifact from a bilingual source text (e.g., a reference to the Danish artist Bj\u00f8rn N\u00f8rgaard).  \n\nA natural, literal translation into German is therefore obtained by:  \n- Rendering \"The sculptor\" as the German equivalent \"Der Bildhauer,\"  \n- Keeping the proper name unchanged,  \n- Translating \"is already crafting\" with the present-tense verb \"fertigt \u2026 bereits,\"  \n- Rendering \"a sarcophagus\" as \"einen Sarkophag,\" and  \n- Rendering \"for the two of them\" as the concise \"f\u00fcr die beiden.\"  \n\nThe resulting German sentence is therefore fully idiomatic while preserving the original meaning.\n\n\\boxed{Der Bildhauer Bj\u00f8rn N\u00f8rgaard fertigt bereits einen Sarkophag f\u00fcr die beiden.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 172, "output_tokens": 187, "total_tokens": 359}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.0006825, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_883", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nMcVitie's owner Pladis said it had invested more than \u00a35m at the site in the last few years.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{Der Eigent\u00fcmer von McVitie's, Pladis, sagte, er habe in den letzten Jahren mehr als 5 Mio. \u00a3 am Standort investiert.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 55, "output_tokens": 43, "total_tokens": 98}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 8.205e-06, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_892", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nHogan's staff has blocked and deleted the posts of at least 450 people who voiced their opinions on his official Facebook page.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{Hogans Mitarbeiter haben die Beitr\u00e4ge von mindestens 450 Personen blockiert und gel\u00f6scht, die ihre Meinungen auf seiner offiziellen Facebook-Seite ge\u00e4u\u00dfert hatten.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 56, "output_tokens": 48, "total_tokens": 104}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 8.776e-06, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_90", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThe bombs of the Allies tore many holes in the city centre in December 1944.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{Die Bomben der Alliierten rissen im Dezember 1944 viele L\u00f6cher in das Stadtzentrum.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 48, "output_tokens": 31, "total_tokens": 79}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 6.507999999999999e-06, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_900", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nWhile first aid was being given to the injured by the emergency services, the A7 was closed for around an hour in the northerly direction, before traffic was able to be led round the site of the accident in the left lane.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "W\u00e4hrend die Rettungskr\u00e4fte Erste Hilfe f\u00fcr die Verletzten leisteten, war die A7 in n\u00f6rdlicher Richtung etwa eine Stunde lang gesperrt, bevor der Verkehr \u00fcber die linke Fahrspur um die Unfallstelle herumgeleitet werden konnte.\n\n\\boxed{{W\u00e4hrend die Rettungskr\u00e4fte Erste Hilfe f\u00fcr die Verletzten leisteten, war die A7 in n\u00f6rdlicher Richtung etwa eine Stunde lang gesperrt, bevor der Verkehr \u00fcber die linke Fahrspur um die Unfallstelle herumgeleitet werden konnte.}}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 76, "output_tokens": 142, "total_tokens": 218}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.9596e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_91", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nThey include Acrocanthosaurus, a 38ft (11.5m) long monster weighing six tonnes.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{Dazu geh\u00f6ren Acrocanthosaurus, ein 11,5 Meter (38 Fu\u00df) langes Monster mit einem Gewicht von sechs Tonnen.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 55, "output_tokens": 40, "total_tokens": 95}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 7.905e-06, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_917", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nAccording to rights activists, more than 500,000 Papuans have been killed, and thousands more have been raped, tortured and imprisoned by the Indonesian military since 1969.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{Nach Angaben von Menschenrechtsaktivisten wurden seit 1969 mehr als 500.000 Papuas get\u00f6tet, und Tausende wurden von der indonesischen Armee vergewaltigt, gefoltert und inhaftiert.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 71, "output_tokens": 64, "total_tokens": 135}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.1441e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_95", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nHow and from when are customers being notified of updates?\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The English sentence is a question about the method and starting point of customer notifications regarding updates. A direct and natural German translation preserves the interrogative structure while using standard phrasing:\n\n- \"How\" translates as \"Wie\".\n- \"And from when\" translates as \"und ab wann\" (using \"ab wann\" to indicate the starting point of the notifications).\n- \"Are customers being notified\" translates as \"werden Kunden benachrichtigt\" (passive voice in present continuous, inverted for the question form).\n- \"Of updates\" translates as \"\u00fcber Updates\" (\"Updates\" is commonly retained in German technical contexts; \"Aktualisierungen\" is an equivalent alternative).\n\nCombining these yields the grammatically correct German question \"Wie und ab wann werden Kunden \u00fcber Updates benachrichtigt?\".\n\n\\boxed{Wie und ab wann werden Kunden \u00fcber Updates benachrichtigt?}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 161, "output_tokens": 178, "total_tokens": 339}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00064625, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_961", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nNick Rascona hugs two of his castmates, and then breaks down crying in their arms; the emotional toll of the performance finally getting to him.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence describes an emotional scene involving an actor named Nick Rascona. To translate it accurately into German while preserving the original meaning, structure, and tone:\n\n- Retain the proper name \"Nick Rascona\" unchanged.\n- Render \"hugs two of his castmates\" as \"umarmt zwei seiner Mitdarsteller\" (using the natural German term for fellow actors in a performance context).\n- Translate \"breaks down crying in their arms\" as \"bricht dann weinend in ihren Armen zusammen\" to capture the collapse and location.\n- Convert the explanatory clause after the semicolon (\"the emotional toll of the performance finally getting to him\") into \"die emotionale Belastung der Auff\u00fchrung holt ihn endlich ein,\" choosing \"Auff\u00fchrung\" for theatrical performance and a direct equivalent for \"emotional toll\" and \"getting to him.\"\n\nCombining these elements yields a fluent, faithful German rendering that maintains the original sentence's flow and semicolon connection.\n\n\\boxed{Nick Rascona umarmt zwei seiner Mitdarsteller u. bricht dann weinend in ihren Armen zusammen; die emotionale Belastung der Auff\u00fchrung holt ihn endlich ein.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 180, "output_tokens": 238, "total_tokens": 418}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00082, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-de-en_97", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to German.\n\nIn addition, the fenced-off area is not allowed to be farmable with a tractor (gradient of over 35 per cent) and must therefore be threatened with afforestation.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Zus\u00e4tzlich darf die eingez\u00e4unte Fl\u00e4che nicht mit einem Traktor bewirtschaftet werden (Steigung \u00fcber 35 Prozent) und muss daher mit Aufforstung bedroht sein. \n\n\\boxed{\\text{Zus\u00e4tzlich darf die eingez\u00e4unte Fl\u00e4che nicht mit einem Traktor bewirtschaftet werden (Steigung \u00fcber 35 Prozent) und muss daher mit Aufforstung bedroht sein.}}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 64, "output_tokens": 94, "total_tokens": 158}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.3943999999999999e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-fi-en_1", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nPeople living and registered with a GP in England will also be able to enrol for potential participation at their local participating sexual health clinic.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The English sentence describes eligibility for study participation and must be rendered in natural, idiomatic Finnish while preserving all technical nuances (GP registration, \u201cenrol,\u201d \u201cpotential participation,\u201d and the clinic descriptor).\n\n- \u201cPeople living and registered with a GP\u201d \u2192 \u201cEnglannissa asuvat ja yleisl\u00e4\u00e4k\u00e4rin kirjoilla olevat henkil\u00f6t\u201d (standard phrasing for UK primary-care registration).  \n- \u201cwill also be able to enrol for potential participation\u201d \u2192 \u201cvoivat my\u00f6s ilmoittautua mahdolliseen osallistumiseen.\u201d  \n- \u201cat their local participating sexual health clinic\u201d \u2192 \u201cpaikallisessa osallistuvassa seksuaaliterveysklinikassaan\u201d (both adjectives kept attributive and the possessive suffix retained for natural flow).\n\nCombining these elements yields a concise, grammatically correct Finnish sentence that conveys the original meaning without addition or omission.\n\n\\boxed{Englannissa asuvat ja yleisl\u00e4\u00e4k\u00e4rin kirjoilla olevat henkil\u00f6t voivat my\u00f6s ilmoittautua mahdolliseen osallistumiseen paikallisessa osallistuvassa seksuaaliterveysklinikassaan.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 176, "output_tokens": 227, "total_tokens": 403}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.0007875, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-fi-en_147", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nWe can't take our children to the day-care centre or go to work without it\", Tommi says.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The English sentence consists of a quoted statement followed by an attribution (\"Tommi says\").  \n\nA direct, natural Finnish rendering preserves both the meaning and the original structure:  \n- \"We can't\" becomes the negated first-person plural \"Emme voi\".  \n- \"take our children to the day-care centre\" is rendered as \"vied\u00e4 lapsiamme p\u00e4iv\u00e4kotiin\" (p\u00e4iv\u00e4koti being the standard term for a day-care centre).  \n- \"or go to work\" is \"tai menn\u00e4 t\u00f6ihin\".  \n- \"without it\" is expressed by the postpositional phrase \"ilman sit\u00e4\".  \n- The attribution is kept verbatim at the end, with \"says\" translated as \"sanoo\".  \n\nPutting these elements together yields the fluent translation  \n\n\"Emme voi vied\u00e4 lapsiamme p\u00e4iv\u00e4kotiin tai menn\u00e4 t\u00f6ihin ilman sit\u00e4\", Tommi sanoo.\n\n\\boxed{\"Emme voi vied\u00e4 lapsiamme p\u00e4iv\u00e4kotiin tai menn\u00e4 t\u00f6ihin ilman sit\u00e4\", Tommi sanoo.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 171, "output_tokens": 210, "total_tokens": 381}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00073875, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-fi-en_149", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nPossible indoor climate problems investigated in S\u00e4kyl\u00e4\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The English sentence appears to be a headline or title fragment, so the Finnish rendering should preserve a similarly concise, title-like structure while using standard terminology. In Finnish building/health contexts, \u201cindoor climate problems\u201d is conventionally rendered as the compound \u201csis\u00e4ilmasto-ongelmat\u201d (or the slightly shorter \u201csis\u00e4ilmaongelmat\u201d).  \n\n\u201cPossible\u201d becomes the adjective \u201cmahdollisia\u201d (partitive plural to agree with the following noun).  \n\u201cInvestigated in S\u00e4kyl\u00e4\u201d is expressed by the past participle \u201ctutkittuja\u201d followed by the inessive place-name \u201cS\u00e4kyl\u00e4ss\u00e4,\u201d yielding the compact headline-style phrase  \n\nS\u00e4kyl\u00e4ss\u00e4 tutkittuja mahdollisia sis\u00e4ilmasto-ongelmia.\n\nThis keeps the original word order, maintains natural Finnish compounding, and respects the title register of the source.\n\n\\boxed{S\u00e4kyl\u00e4ss\u00e4 tutkittuja mahdollisia sis\u00e4ilmasto-ongelmia}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 161, "output_tokens": 200, "total_tokens": 361}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00070125, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-fi-en_190", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nLast year, the comparative operating profit increased as a result of the US Blenders Tax Credit tax concession.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence involves standard financial terminology, which must be rendered accurately in Finnish business language. \"Last year\" translates directly as \"Viime vuonna\". The phrase \"comparative operating profit\" is conventionally expressed in Finnish annual reports and financial statements as \"vertailukelpoinen liikevoitto\". \"Increased\" is rendered as \"kasvoi\". The causal expression \"as a result of\" is idiomatically conveyed by \"seurauksena\" (or the near-synonym \"ansiosta\" when the outcome is positive). Finally, the proper-name tax incentive \"US Blenders Tax Credit tax concession\" is kept in its English form (as is conventional for named fiscal instruments) and paired with the established Finnish term \"verohuojennus\", yielding the compact compound \"US Blenders Tax Credit -verohuojennuksen\".\n\nPutting these elements together produces the fluent, domain-appropriate translation  \n\"Viime vuonna vertailukelpoinen liikevoitto kasvoi US Blenders Tax Credit -verohuojennuksen seurauksena.\"\n\n\\boxed{Viime v. vertailukelp. liikevoitto kasvoi US Blenders Tax Credit -verohuojennuksen seurauksena.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 171, "output_tokens": 240, "total_tokens": 411}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00081375, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-fi-en_201", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nOn the opposite wall is her mitochondrial DNA sequence - a centipede of Cs and Gs and As, written in pencil.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence describes a visual scene in a somewhat literary style, so the Finnish rendering must preserve both the factual content and the metaphorical phrasing while respecting Finnish grammar and natural word order.\n\n- \u201cOn the opposite wall is \u2026\u201d becomes the idiomatic presentative construction \u201cVastakkaisella sein\u00e4ll\u00e4 on \u2026\u201d.  \n- \u201cMitochondrial DNA sequence\u201d is rendered by the established compound \u201cmitokondriaalinen DNA-sekvenssi\u201d. The possessive \u201cher\u201d is expressed by the suffix \u201c-ns\u00e4\u201d.  \n- The appositive phrase \u201ca centipede of Cs and Gs and As\u201d is translated literally but idiomatically: \u201cjuoksujalkainen\u201d is the correct zoological term for centipede, and the letters are inflected in the partitive plural (\u201cC:iden, G:iden ja A:iden\u201d).  \n- \u201cWritten in pencil\u201d is rendered by the adverbial construction \u201clyijykyn\u00e4ll\u00e4 kirjoitettuna\u201d, which keeps the participial flavour of the original.\n\nPutting these elements together yields a fluent, faithful translation:\n\nVastakkaisella sein\u00e4ll\u00e4 on h\u00e4nen mitokondriaalinen DNA-sekvenssins\u00e4 \u2013 C:iden, G:iden ja A:iden juoksujalkainen, lyijykyn\u00e4ll\u00e4 kirjoitettuna.\n\n\\boxed{Vastakkaisella sein\u00e4ll\u00e4 on h\u00e4nen mitokondriaalinen DNA-sekvenssins\u00e4 \u2013 C:iden, G:iden ja A:iden juoksujalkainen, lyijykyn\u00e4ll\u00e4 kirjoitettuna.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 175, "output_tokens": 315, "total_tokens": 490}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00100625, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-fi-en_222", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nFinance Finland (FFI) recommends that individuals working in investment services complete its APV1 or AVP2 qualifications.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{Finance Finland (FFI) suosittelee, ett\u00e4 sijoituspalveluissa toimivat henkil\u00f6t suorittavat sen APV1- tai AVP2-tutkinnon.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 52, "output_tokens": 52, "total_tokens": 104}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 8.891999999999999e-06, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-fi-en_23", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nFleet-footed tortoise escaped again from a Japanese zoo\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The English sentence to be translated is a concise headline-style statement. Breaking it down word by word yields the following Finnish equivalents:\n\n- \u201cFleet-footed\u201d \u2192 \u201cnopeajalkainen\u201d (a direct, idiomatic compound adjective).  \n- \u201cTortoise\u201d \u2192 \u201ckilpikonna\u201d (the standard general term).  \n- \u201cEscaped\u201d \u2192 \u201ckarkasi\u201d (the natural verb for an animal escaping from captivity).  \n- \u201cAgain\u201d \u2192 \u201ctaas\u201d (concise and headline-appropriate).  \n- \u201cFrom a Japanese zoo\u201d \u2192 \u201cjapanilaisesta el\u00e4intarhasta\u201d (the partitive case after the elative preposition \u201cfrom\u201d).\n\nAssembling these elements while preserving the original word order and headline tone produces the grammatically correct Finnish sentence \u201cNopeajalkainen kilpikonna karkasi taas japanilaisesta el\u00e4intarhasta.\u201d\n\n\\boxed{Nopeajalkainen kilpikonna karkasi taas japanilaisesta el\u00e4intarhasta}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 160, "output_tokens": 206, "total_tokens": 366}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.000715, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-fi-en_243", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nIt suggests the dinosaur was hunted by enough pressure meat-eating dinosaurs that evolution favoured concealment over confrontation as a means of survival.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The given English sentence contains somewhat awkward or possibly erroneous phrasing in the middle (\u201chunted by enough pressure meat-eating dinosaurs\u201d), which appears to intend the meaning \u201csubjected to sufficient predatory pressure from meat-eating dinosaurs.\u201d The translation therefore renders the clause in natural Finnish while preserving that intended sense.\n\nA direct, idiomatic rendering is therefore:\n\nSe viittaa siihen, ett\u00e4 dinosaurusta saalistettiin niin paljon lihansy\u00f6j\u00e4dinosaurusten taholta, ett\u00e4 evoluutio suosi piiloutumista yhteenoton sijaan selviytymiskeinona.\n\n- \u201cIt suggests\u201d \u2192 \u201cSe viittaa siihen, ett\u00e4\u201d (standard in scientific or interpretive contexts).  \n- \u201cwas hunted \u2026 meat-eating dinosaurs\u201d \u2192 \u201csaalistettiin \u2026 lihansy\u00f6j\u00e4dinosaurusten taholta\u201d (captures the predatory-pressure idea).  \n- \u201cevolution favoured concealment over confrontation\u201d \u2192 \u201cevoluutio suosi piiloutumista yhteenoton sijaan\u201d (concise and accurate).  \n- \u201cas a means of survival\u201d \u2192 \u201cselviytymiskeinona\u201d (natural adverbial phrase).\n\nThe result is a fluent Finnish sentence that conveys the original meaning without adding or omitting information.\n\n\\boxed{Se viittaa siihen, ett\u00e4 dinosaurusta saalistettiin niin paljon lihansy\u00f6j\u00e4dinosaurusten taholta, ett\u00e4 evoluutio suosi piiloutumista yhteenoton sijaan selviytymiskeinona.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 174, "output_tokens": 298, "total_tokens": 472}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.0009625, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-fi-en_247", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nRepublicans in Congress are pushing for a broader rewrite of the ozone rules.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence translates naturally into Finnish as follows:\n\n- \"Republicans\" becomes *republikaanit* (standard political term).  \n- \"in Congress\" becomes *kongressissa* (locative case).  \n- \"are pushing for\" is rendered with *ajavat*, the most idiomatic verb for political advocacy.  \n- \"a broader rewrite\" is expressed as *laajempaa uudelleenkirjoitusta* (partitive case, preserving the sense of revision).  \n- \"of the ozone rules\" is *otsonis\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6jen* (genitive plural; \"otsoni-\" is the established technical prefix for ozone-related regulation).\n\nPutting the elements together yields the fluent Finnish sentence  \n**Kongressin republikaanit ajavat otsonis\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6jen laajempaa uudelleenkirjoitusta.**\n\n\\boxed{Kongressin republikaanit ajavat otsonis\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6jen laajempaa uudelleenkirjoitusta.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 165, "output_tokens": 203, "total_tokens": 368}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00071375, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-fi-en_252", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nDoyle remembers her first world championships, when the only other Scot in the team was Lee McConnell.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence to be translated is a self-contained statement in the present tense, with two clauses linked by a temporal conjunction. The proper name \u201cDoyle\u201d and the given name \u201cLee McConnell\u201d remain unchanged.  \n\n- \u201cRemembers\u201d is rendered by the Finnish verb muistaa.  \n- \u201cHer first world championships\u201d is expressed as ensimm\u00e4iset MM-kilpailunsa (or the fuller form ensimm\u00e4iset maailmanmestaruuskilpailunsa); the abbreviation MM-kilpailut is the conventional sports-register term for world championships.  \n- The subordinate clause \u201cwhen the only other Scot in the team was \u2026\u201d is introduced by jolloin; \u201cScot\u201d becomes skotti, \u201cthe only other \u2026 in the team\u201d is rendered joukkueen ainoa toinen, and the copula \u201cwas\u201d is oli.  \n\nCombining these elements yields the grammatically natural Finnish sentence  \n\nDoyle muistaa ensimm\u00e4iset MM-kilpailunsa, jolloin joukkueen ainoa toinen skotti oli Lee McConnell.\n\n\\boxed{Doyle muistaa ensimm\u00e4iset MM-kilpailunsa, jolloin joukkueen ainoa toinen skotti oli Lee McConnell.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 171, "output_tokens": 232, "total_tokens": 403}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00079375, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-fi-en_285", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nOn Aug. 9, 2014, Brittany Ferrell was shaken to her core.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence to be translated is \u201cOn Aug. 9, 2014, Brittany Ferrell was shaken to her core.\u201d  \n\n- The date is rendered in the conventional Finnish order and morphology: \u201c9. elokuuta 2014.\u201d  \n- The proper name \u201cBrittany Ferrell\u201d remains unchanged.  \n- The English idiom \u201cshaken to her core\u201d is expressed by the natural Finnish collocation \u201cj\u00e4rkyttyi syd\u00e4njuuriaan my\u00f6ten,\u201d which conveys deep emotional disturbance while preserving the original passive construction.  \n\nPutting these elements together yields the fluent Finnish sentence  \n\n9. elokuuta 2014 Brittany Ferrell j\u00e4rkyttyi syd\u00e4njuuriaan my\u00f6ten.\n\n\\boxed{9. elokuuta 2014 Brittany Ferrell j\u00e4rkyttyi syd\u00e4njuuriaan my\u00f6ten.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 169, "output_tokens": 170, "total_tokens": 339}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00063625, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-fi-en_375", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nSalvador Adame disappeared in the western state of Michoacan three days after Valdez was killed.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Salvador Adame katosi l\u00e4ntisess\u00e4 Michoac\u00e1nin osavaltiossa kolme p\u00e4iv\u00e4\u00e4 sen j\u00e4lkeen, kun Valdez tapettiin.\n\nThe translation preserves proper names (Salvador Adame, Valdez, Michoac\u00e1n) unchanged, renders the past-tense verb \u201cdisappeared\u201d as the natural Finnish equivalent \u201ckatosi,\u201d and expresses the locative phrase \u201cin the western state of Michoacan\u201d with the standard Finnish word order \u201cl\u00e4ntisess\u00e4 Michoac\u00e1nin osavaltiossa.\u201d The temporal clause \u201cthree days after Valdez was killed\u201d is rendered with the idiomatic construction \u201ckolme p\u00e4iv\u00e4\u00e4 sen j\u00e4lkeen, kun Valdez tapettiin,\u201d maintaining the original sentence structure and meaning.\n\n\\boxed{Salvador Adame katosi l\u00e4ntisess\u00e4 Michoac\u00e1nin osavaltiossa 3 pv sen j\u00e4lkeen kun Valdez tapettiin.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 170, "output_tokens": 170, "total_tokens": 340}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.0006375, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-fi-en_395", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nHowever, the significance of open source software cannot be measured in money alone, as the majority of users do not pay anything for its use.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Kuitenkin avoimen l\u00e4hdekoodin ohjelmistojen merkityst\u00e4 ei voida mitata pelk\u00e4st\u00e4\u00e4n rahassa, sill\u00e4 suurin osa k\u00e4ytt\u00e4jist\u00e4 ei maksa niiden k\u00e4yt\u00f6st\u00e4 mit\u00e4\u00e4n.\n\n\\boxed{Kuitenkin avoimen l\u00e4hdekoodin ohjelmistojen merkityst\u00e4 ei voida mitata pelk\u00e4st\u00e4\u00e4n rahassa, sill\u00e4 suurin osa k\u00e4ytt\u00e4jist\u00e4 ei maksa niiden k\u00e4yt\u00f6st\u00e4 mit\u00e4\u00e4n.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 178, "output_tokens": 90, "total_tokens": 268}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.0004475, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-fi-en_402", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nThe most popular cloud services, such as Amazon AWS, Microsoft Azure and Alibaba Cloud, offer MariaDB to their customers.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence translates naturally into Finnish as follows:\n\n- \"The most popular cloud services\" becomes \"Suosituimmat pilvipalvelut\" (standard term for cloud services in Finnish).  \n- \"such as Amazon AWS, Microsoft Azure and Alibaba Cloud\" remains essentially unchanged for the proper nouns, rendered as \"kuten Amazon AWS, Microsoft Azure ja Alibaba Cloud\" (Finnish uses \"ja\" before the final list item).  \n- \"offer MariaDB to their customers\" becomes \"tarjoavat MariaDB:t\u00e4 asiakkailleen\", applying the partitive case to MariaDB (as is conventional for offering a product/service) and the appropriate possessive/allative form for \"their customers\".  \n\nCombining these yields the full, grammatically correct translation while preserving the original meaning and structure.\n\n\\boxed{Suosituimmat pilvipalvelut, kuten Amazon AWS, Microsoft Azure ja Alibaba Cloud, tarjoavat MariaDB:t\u00e4 asiakkailleen.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 174, "output_tokens": 193, "total_tokens": 367}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.0007, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-fi-en_610", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nOn Saturday, rains are expected in many parts of southern and central areas with a chance of thunderstorms.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence is translated by breaking it into its core components and mapping them to natural Finnish phrasing, particularly using standard meteorological terminology:\n\n- \u201cOn Saturday\u201d becomes \u201cLauantaina\u201d.\n- \u201cRains are expected\u201d is rendered as \u201csateita odotetaan\u201d.\n- \u201cIn many parts of southern and central areas\u201d is expressed concisely as \u201cetel\u00e4- ja keskiosien monilla alueilla\u201d.\n- The qualifying clause \u201cwith a chance of thunderstorms\u201d attaches directly via the instrumental construction \u201cukkoskuurojen mahdollisuudella\u201d.\n\nCombining these yields the compact, idiomatic Finnish sentence  \n\u201cLauantaina sateita odotetaan etel\u00e4- ja keskiosien monilla alueilla ukkoskuurojen mahdollisuudella.\u201d\n\n\\boxed{Lauantaina sateita odotetaan etel\u00e4- ja keskiosien monilla alueilla ukkoskuurojen mahdollisuudella.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 170, "output_tokens": 189, "total_tokens": 359}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.000685, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-fi-en_668", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nThe creature was found by Shawn Funk, when he was digging at the Millenium Mine near Fort McMurray in northern Alberta, Canada, on March 21, 2011.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{Olennon l\u00f6ysi Shawn Funk, kun h\u00e4n oli kaivamassa Millenium-kyl\u00e4n kaivoksessa Fort McMurrayssa pohjoisessa Albertassa Kanadassa 21. maaliskuuta 2011.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 68, "output_tokens": 59, "total_tokens": 127}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.0728e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-fi-en_67", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nBefore the accident, 23-year-old Suur-Hamari was losing interest in snowboarding.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{Onnettomuuden j\u00e4lkeen 23-vuotias Suur-Hamari menetti kiinnostuksensa snowboardia kohtaan.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 49, "output_tokens": 40, "total_tokens": 89}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 7.478999999999999e-06, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-fi-en_680", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nOne of the children is almost three years old, and the other is under 12 months of age.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "To translate the sentence \"One of the children is almost three years old, and the other is under 12 months of age\" into Finnish, we can use the following structure:\n\n*   \"One of the children\" = *Toinen lapsista* (or *Toinen lapsi*)\n*   \"is almost three years old\" = *on melkein kolmevuotias*\n*   \"and the other\" = *ja toinen*\n*   \"is under 12 months of age\" = *on alle 12 kuukauden ik\u00e4inen* (or *alle vuoden ik\u00e4inen*)\n\nCombining these, we get:\n*Toinen lapsista on melkein kolmevuotias ja toinen on alle 12 kuukauden ik\u00e4inen.*\n\n(Note: In Finnish, when referring to two people, \"toinen... toinen...\" is the standard way to say \"one... the other...\".)\n\n\\boxed{Toinen lapsista on melkein kolmevuotias ja toinen on alle 12 kuukauden ik\u00e4inen.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 45, "output_tokens": 235, "total_tokens": 280}, "provider": "Google AI Studio", "model_used": "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "requested_model": "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "invoked_at": "2026-08-05T17:01:40.502160+00:00"}, "cost": 0.00036375, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-fi-en_693", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nAccording to the survey, key factors among young Syrians are the war in Syria and the presence of Isis in the country.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence is translated by rendering each segment naturally while preserving the original meaning and structure:\n\n- \"According to the survey\" becomes the standard Finnish phrase \"Kyselyn mukaan\".\n- \"key factors among young Syrians\" is expressed as \"nuorten syyrialaisten keskuudessa keskeisi\u00e4 tekij\u00f6it\u00e4\", which captures both the sense of importance and the notion of prevalence among the specified group.\n- \"are the war in Syria and the presence of Isis in the country\" translates directly to \"ovat Syyrian sota ja Isisin l\u00e4sn\u00e4olo maassa\", retaining the proper nouns in their conventional Finnish forms.\n\nCombining these yields the fluent, idiomatic result \"Kyselyn mukaan nuorten syyrialaisten keskuudessa keskeisi\u00e4 tekij\u00f6it\u00e4 ovat Syyrian sota ja Isisin l\u00e4sn\u00e4olo maassa.\"\n\n\\boxed{Kyselyn mukaan nuorten syyrialaisten keskuudessa keskeisi\u00e4 tekij\u00f6it\u00e4 ovat Syyrian sota ja Isisin l\u00e4sn\u00e4olo maassa.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 175, "output_tokens": 212, "total_tokens": 387}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00074875, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-fi-en_702", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nIt has been known to infect doves, particularly pigeons.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence \"It has been known to infect doves, particularly pigeons\" is an example of a construction indicating reported or observed behavior (commonly seen in scientific or medical contexts). A natural and accurate Finnish rendering therefore begins with the idiomatic phrase \"Sen tiedet\u00e4\u00e4n tartuttavan,\" which conveys the same epistemic meaning.\n\n- \"Doves\" is rendered as the general term *kyyhkysi\u00e4*.  \n- \"Pigeons\" is rendered by the more specific everyday term *puluja*.  \n- \"Particularly\" is translated by the adverb *erityisesti*, preserving both register and emphasis.\n\nThe resulting Finnish sentence is therefore grammatical, idiomatic, and semantically faithful to the source.\n\n\\boxed{Sen tiedet\u00e4\u00e4n tartuttavan kyyhkysi\u00e4, erityisesti puluja.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 161, "output_tokens": 158, "total_tokens": 319}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00059625, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-fi-en_731", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nThe 110-million-year-old creature, part of the nodosaur family, first hit headlines in May and is now on view at the Royal Tyrrell Museum of Palaeontology.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{110 miljoonaa vuotta vanha olento, joka kuuluu nodosaurheimoonsa, sai ensimm\u00e4ist\u00e4 kertaa otsikkoja toukokuussa ja on nyt n\u00e4ht\u00e4vill\u00e4 Royal Tyrrellin paleontologian museossa.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 66, "output_tokens": 71, "total_tokens": 137}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.1786000000000002e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-fi-en_732", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nIn the 2000s, the disease was also discovered in finches.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The English sentence to be translated is \u201cIn the 2000s, the disease was also discovered in finches.\u201d\n\n- \u201cIn the 2000s\u201d is rendered in Finnish as the adessive phrase \u201c2000-luvulla\u201d.\n- \u201cThe disease\u201d is simply \u201ctauti\u201d.\n- \u201cWas \u2026 discovered\u201d is expressed by the passive past-tense verb \u201cl\u00f6ydettiin\u201d.\n- \u201cAlso\u201d is the adverb \u201cmy\u00f6s\u201d.\n- \u201cIn finches\u201d uses the inessive plural of the standard ornithological term for finches (Fringillidae), which is \u201cpeipoissa\u201d.\n\nPutting these elements together yields the grammatically natural Finnish sentence  \n\u201c2000-luvulla tauti l\u00f6ydettiin my\u00f6s peipoissa.\u201d\n\n\\boxed{2000-luvulla tauti l\u00f6ydettiin my\u00f6s peipoissa.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 166, "output_tokens": 167, "total_tokens": 333}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.000625, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-fi-en_754", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Finnish.\n\nAfter Garcia's victory by unanimous decision over former four-division world champion Adrien Broner on Saturday on Showtime, both fighters are members of the top-five pound-for-pound list.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence concerns a boxing match, so boxing terminology must be rendered naturally in Finnish while preserving the original meaning and sentence structure. Key terms are translated as follows:\n\n- \u201cGarcia\u2019s victory by unanimous decision\u201d becomes \u201cGarcian voitettua \u2026 yksimielisell\u00e4 p\u00e4\u00e4t\u00f6ksell\u00e4\u201d (the participial construction mirrors the English \u201cafter\u201d clause).  \n- \u201cFormer four-division world champion\u201d is rendered \u201centisen nelj\u00e4n painoluokan maailmanmestarin\u201d.  \n- \u201cOn Saturday on Showtime\u201d stays close to the original: \u201clauantaina Showtimessa\u201d.  \n- \u201cBoth fighters are members of the top-five pound-for-pound list\u201d is expressed as \u201cmolemmat ottelijat kuuluvat viiden parhaan joukkoon pound-for-pound-listalla\u201d, keeping the conventional English term \u201cpound-for-pound\u201d that is universally used in Finnish boxing commentary.\n\nCombining these elements yields a single, idiomatic Finnish sentence that retains the original information and word order as closely as possible.\n\n\\boxed{Garcian voitettua ent. 4 painoluokan mm Adrien Bronerin yksimielisell\u00e4 p\u00e4\u00e4t\u00f6ksell\u00e4 lauantaina Showtimessa, molemmat ottelijat kuuluvat top-5 pound-for-pound -listalle.}", "success": true,