answer": "The sentence discusses a debatable economic topic involving interest rates and quantitative easing, followed by a personal recommendation on using a specific adjusted bond differential. To translate accurately into Kazakh, economic terminology must be rendered with standard equivalents (e.g., \u201cinterest rate\u201d as \u043f\u0430\u0439\u044b\u0437\u0434\u044b\u049b \u043c\u04e9\u043b\u0448\u0435\u0440\u043b\u0435\u043c\u0435, \u201cquantitative easing\u201d as \u0441\u0430\u043d\u0434\u044b\u049b \u0436\u04b1\u043c\u0441\u0430\u0440\u0442\u0443, \u201cgovernment bond\u201d as \u043c\u0435\u043c\u043b\u0435\u043a\u0435\u0442\u0442\u0456\u043a \u043e\u0431\u043b\u0438\u0433\u0430\u0446\u0438\u044f, and \u201cinflation expectations\u201d as \u0438\u043d\u0444\u043b\u044f\u0446\u0438\u044f\u043b\u044b\u049b \u043a\u04af\u0442\u0443\u043b\u0435\u0440). The clause structure is preserved by placing the subject\u2013predicate debate phrase first, mirroring the concessive \u201cbut\u201d clause with \u0431\u0456\u0440\u0430\u049b, and retaining the double-negative construction \u201cno good reason not to use\u201d as \u0435\u0448\u049b\u0430\u043d\u0434\u0430\u0439 \u0436\u0430\u049b\u0441\u044b \u0441\u0435\u0431\u0435\u043f \u043a\u04e9\u0440\u043c\u0435\u0439\u043c\u0456\u043d. The resulting translation is therefore:\n\n\u0421\u0430\u043b\u044b\u0441\u0442\u044b\u0440\u0443 \u04af\u0448\u0456\u043d \u049b\u0430\u0439 \u043f\u0430\u0439\u044b\u0437\u0434\u044b\u049b \u043c\u04e9\u043b\u0448\u0435\u0440\u043b\u0435\u043c\u0435 \u0435\u04a3 \u0436\u0430\u049b\u0441\u044b \u0435\u043a\u0435\u043d\u0456 \u043f\u0456\u043a\u0456\u0440\u0442\u0430\u043b\u0430\u0441 \u043c\u04d9\u0441\u0435\u043b\u0435\u0441\u0456 \u0431\u043e\u043b\u044b\u043f \u0442\u0430\u0431\u044b\u043b\u0430\u0434\u044b, \u0441\u0430\u043d\u0434\u044b\u049b \u0436\u04b1\u043c\u0441\u0430\u0440\u0442\u0443\u0434\u044b\u04a3 \u04d9\u0441\u0435\u0440\u043b\u0435\u0440\u0456 \u0441\u0438\u044f\u049b\u0442\u044b; \u0431\u0456\u0440\u0430\u049b \u0438\u043d\u0444\u043b\u044f\u0446\u0438\u044f\u043b\u044b\u049b \u043a\u04af\u0442\u0443\u043b\u0435\u0440\u0433\u0435 \u0442\u04af\u0437\u0435\u0442\u0456\u043b\u0433\u0435\u043d \u043e\u043d \u0436\u044b\u043b\u0434\u044b\u049b \u043c\u0435\u043c\u043b\u0435\u043a\u0435\u0442\u0442\u0456\u043a \u043e\u0431\u043b\u0438\u0433\u0430\u0446\u0438\u044f \u0434\u0438\u0444\u0444\u0435\u0440\u0435\u043d\u0446\u0438\u0430\u043b\u044b\u043d \u049b\u043e\u043b\u0434\u0430\u043d\u0431\u0430\u0443\u0493\u0430 \u043c\u0435\u043d \u0435\u0448\u049b\u0430\u043d\u0434\u0430\u0439 \u0436\u0430\u049b\u0441\u044b \u0441\u0435\u0431\u0435\u043f \u043a\u04e9\u0440\u043c\u0435\u0439\u043c\u0456\u043d.\n\n\\boxed{\u0421\u0430\u043b\u044b\u0441\u0442\u044b\u0440\u0443 \u04af\u0448\u0456\u043d \u049b\u0430\u0439 \u043f\u0430\u0439\u044b\u0437\u0434\u044b\u049b \u043c\u04e9\u043b\u0448\u0435\u0440\u043b\u0435\u043c\u0435 \u0435\u04a3 \u0436\u0430\u049b\u0441\u044b \u0435\u043a\u0435\u043d\u0456 \u043f\u0456\u043a\u0456\u0440\u0442\u0430\u043b\u0430\u0441 \u043c\u04d9\u0441\u0435\u043b\u0435\u0441\u0456 \u0431\u043e\u043b\u044b\u043f \u0442\u0430\u0431\u044b\u043b\u0430\u0434\u044b, \u0441\u0430\u043d\u0434\u044b\u049b \u0436\u04b1\u043c\u0441\u0430\u0440\u0442\u0443\u0434\u044b\u04a3 \u04d9\u0441\u0435\u0440\u043b\u0435\u0440\u0456 \u0441\u0438\u044f\u049b\u0442\u044b; \u0431\u0456\u0440\u0430\u049b \u0438\u043d\u0444\u043b\u044f\u0446\u0438\u044f\u043b\u044b\u049b \u043a\u04af\u0442\u0443\u043b\u0435\u0440\u0433\u0435 \u0442\u04af\u0437\u0435\u0442\u0456\u043b\u0433\u0435\u043d \u043e\u043d \u0436\u044b\u043b\u0434\u044b\u049b \u043c\u0435\u043c\u043b\u0435\u043a\u0435\u0442\u0442\u0456\u043a \u043e\u0431\u043b\u0438\u0433\u0430\u0446\u0438\u044f \u0434\u0438\u0444\u0444\u0435\u0440\u0435\u043d\u0446\u0438\u0430\u043b\u044b\u043d \u049b\u043e\u043b\u0434\u0430\u043d\u0431\u0430\u0443\u0493\u0430 \u043c\u0435\u043d \u0435\u0448\u049b\u0430\u043d\u0434\u0430\u0439 \u0436\u0430\u049b\u0441\u044b \u0441\u0435\u0431\u0435\u043f \u043a\u04e9\u0440\u043c\u0435\u0439\u043c\u0456\u043d.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 193, "output_tokens": 377, "total_tokens": 570}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00118375, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-lt-en_135", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nHow does a dog determine the direction of human tracks?\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "To translate the sentence \"How does a dog determine the direction of human tracks?\" into Lithuanian, we use the following terms:\n*   How = *Kaip*\n*   does a dog determine = *\u0161uo nustato*\n*   the direction = *krypt\u012f*\n*   of human tracks = *\u017emogaus p\u0117dsak\u0173*\n\nPutting it together: \"Kaip \u0161uo nustato \u017emogaus p\u0117dsak\u0173 krypt\u012f?\"\n\n\\boxed{Kaip \u0161uo nustato \u017emogaus p\u0117dsak\u0173 krypt\u012f?}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 34, "output_tokens": 121, "total_tokens": 155}, "provider": "Google AI Studio", "model_used": "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "requested_model": "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "invoked_at": "2026-08-05T17:01:50.420863+00:00"}, "cost": 0.00019, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-lt-en_137", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nCERN organization is best known for its Large Hadron Collider (LHC), the world\u2019s largest and most powerful particle accelerator located in Switzerland.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "CERN organizacija labiausiai \u017einoma d\u0117l savo Did\u017eiojo hadron\u0173 susid\u016brim\u0173 greitintuvo (LHC) \u2013 did\u017eiausio ir galingiausio pasaulyje daleli\u0173 greitintuvo, esan\u010dio \u0160veicarijoje.\n\n\\boxed{CERN org. labiausiai \u017einoma d\u0117l savo Did\u017eiojo hadron\u0173 susid\u016brim\u0173 greitintuvo (LHC) \u2013 did\u017eiausio ir galingiausio pasaulyje daleli\u0173 greitintuvo, esan\u010dio \u0160veicarijoje.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 178, "output_tokens": 115, "total_tokens": 293}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00051, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-lt-en_15", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nFord, 25, of no fixed address, pleaded guilty to burglary, assault by beating, and driving dangerously while disqualified and without a licence.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Ford, 25-eri\u0173, neturintis nuolatinio gyvenamosios vietos, prisipa\u017eino kaltas d\u0117l turto grobimo, smurto, kurio metu jis mu\u0161\u0117, bei pavojingai vairavo b\u016bdamas diskvalifikuotas ir netur\u0117damas vairuotojo pa\u017eym\u0117jimo.\n\n\\boxed{{Ford, 25-eri\u0173, neturintis nuolatinio gyvenamosios vietos, prisipa\u017eino kaltas d\u0117l turto grobimo, smurto, kurio metu jis mu\u0161\u0117, bei pavojingai vairavo b\u016bdamas diskvalifikuotas ir netur\u0117damas vairuotojo pa\u017eym\u0117jimo.}}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 60, "output_tokens": 182, "total_tokens": 242}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 2.2460000000000002e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-lt-en_19", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nThe play's ensemble features Kerry Washington, Steven Pasquale, Eugene Lee and Jeremy Jordan.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence refers to the cast of actors in a theatrical production. A natural and accurate Lithuanian rendering is therefore:\n\n\u201cSpektaklio ansambl\u012f sudaro Kerry Washington, Steven Pasquale, Eugene Lee ir Jeremy Jordan.\u201d\n\n- \u201cThe play\u2019s ensemble\u201d is rendered as \u201cSpektaklio ansambl\u012f\u201d (using the common theatrical term ansamblis for cast/ensemble and the accusative case required by the verb).  \n- \u201cFeatures\u201d is idiomatically expressed by \u201csudaro\u201d (\u201cconsists of / comprises\u201d).  \n- The proper names remain unchanged, and the English conjunction \u201cand\u201d is translated by the Lithuanian \u201cir\u201d.\n\nThis preserves both the meaning and the concise journalistic tone of the original.\n\n\\boxed{Spektaklio ansambl\u012f sudaro Kerry Washington, Steven Pasquale, Eugene Lee ir Jeremy Jordan.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 168, "output_tokens": 169, "total_tokens": 337}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.0006325, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-lt-en_268", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nShaquelle Vidal, 23, the daughter of a TV comedian, died on April 7 after spending almost a month as a \"voluntary\" patient at the Nightingale Hospital in Marylebone, West London.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\u0160ekel\u0117 Vidhal, 23 met\u0173, televizijos komiko dukra, mir\u0117 baland\u017eio 7 d., beveik m\u0117nes\u012f praleidusi kaip \u201esavanor\u0117\u201c pacient\u0117 Naiting\u0117il ligonin\u0117je Merilebone, Vakar\u0173 Londone.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{\u0160ekel\u0117 Vidhal, 23 met\u0173, televizijos komiko dukra, mir\u0117 baland\u017eio 7 d., beveik m\u0117nes\u012f praleidusi kaip \u201esav\u0430\u043dor\u0117\u201c pacient\u0117 Naiting\u0117il ligonin\u0117je Merilebone, Vakar\u0173 Londone.}}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 77, "output_tokens": 159, "total_tokens": 236}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 2.1367e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-lt-en_269", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nLook Over Your Shoulders (featuring Busta Rhymes & Michael Jackson)\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The phrase is a title (likely for a song or track), so a direct, literal translation is appropriate while preserving the original structure, capitalization style, and artist names.\n\n- \"Look Over Your Shoulders\" translates as the imperative \"\u017dvilgtelk per pe\u010dius\" (literally \"glance/look over [your] shoulders\").\n- \"featuring\" is rendered in Lithuanian music credits as the preposition \"su\" (\"with\").\n- Artist names remain unchanged.\n\nThis yields the full translated title \"\u017dvilgtelk per pe\u010dius (su Busta Rhymes & Michael Jackson)\".\n\n\\boxed{\u017dvilgtelk per pe\u010dius (su Busta Rhymes & Michael Jackson)\n}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 166, "output_tokens": 140, "total_tokens": 306}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.0005575, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-lt-en_287", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nWhite or brown: what kind of sugar is recommended by the nutritionist\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence to be translated is a concise, title-style question contrasting two types of sugar and asking for a nutritionist\u2019s recommendation.  \n\n- \u201cWhite or brown\u201d is rendered as the Lithuanian adjectives \u201cbaltas ar rudas\u201d (or the slightly more formal \u201cbaltasis ar rudasis\u201d), which are the conventional descriptors for refined versus unrefined sugar.  \n- \u201cWhat kind of sugar\u201d becomes \u201ckok\u012f cukr\u0173\u201d, preserving the direct object case required by the verb.  \n- \u201cIs recommended by the nutritionist\u201d is expressed with the present passive construction \u201crekomenduoja \u2026 mitybos specialistas\u201d (or the near-synonym \u201cdietologas\u201d), which is the natural Lithuanian way to convey professional advice.  \n\nPutting these elements together yields the fluent, idiomatic Lithuanian sentence  \n\nBaltas ar rudas: kok\u012f cukr\u0173 rekomenduoja mitybos specialistas?  \n\n(The punctuation colon is retained to mirror the original title-like structure.)\n\n\\boxed{Baltas ar rudas: kok\u012f cukr\u0173 rekomenduoja mitybos specialistas?}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 165, "output_tokens": 222, "total_tokens": 387}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00076125, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-lt-en_56", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nThis is due to the fact that bicycle\u2019s tracks are not segmented as human tracks, making it more difficult to isolate different locations for comparison - this is not natural for dogs, so more time is needed.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence involves specialized terminology related to scent tracking (e.g., by dogs), so \u201ctracks\u201d is rendered as \u201cp\u0117dsakai\u201d (footprints/trails) rather than the more generic \u201ctakai.\u201d \u201cSegmented\u201d is kept as the direct technical equivalent \u201csegmentuoti,\u201d which preserves the original meaning of distinct, isolatable sections. The causal structure (\u201cThis is due to the fact that \u2026 making it more difficult \u2026\u201d) is expressed naturally in Lithuanian with \u201cTai lemia faktas, kad \u2026 tod\u0117l sunkiau \u2026,\u201d and the final explanatory clause is joined with an em-dash to retain the original parenthetical tone.\n\nResulting translation:  \nTai lemia faktas, kad dvira\u010dio p\u0117dsakai n\u0117ra segmentuoti kaip \u017emoni\u0173 p\u0117dsakai, tod\u0117l sunkiau i\u0161skirti skirtingas vietas palyginimui \u2013 tai n\u0117ra nat\u016bralu \u0161unims, tod\u0117l reikia daugiau laiko.\n\n\\boxed{Tai lemia fakt\u0105, kad dvira\u010dio p\u0117dsakai n\u0117ra segmentuoti kaip \u017emoni\u0173 p\u0117dsakai, tod\u0117l sunkiau i\u0161skirti skirtingas vietas palyginimui \u2013 tai n\u0117ra nat\u016bralu \u0161unims, tod\u0117l reikia daugiau laiko.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 191, "output_tokens": 246, "total_tokens": 437}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00085375, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-lt-en_601", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nGoing to buy new ones\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The English phrase \"Going to buy new ones\" is a sentence fragment expressing future intention (equivalent to \"I am going to buy new ones\"). In Lithuanian this is rendered with the verb *ketinti* (\"to intend/plan\") plus an infinitive, yielding the natural translation\n\nKetinu nusipirkti naujus.\n\n(The adjective *naujus* is the masculine plural accusative form required when the replaced noun is masculine; the precise ending would agree with whatever noun \"ones\" stands for.)\n\n\\boxed{Ketinu nusipirkti naujus}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 156, "output_tokens": 114, "total_tokens": 270}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00048, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-lt-en_607", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nKnights duel with swords during a medieval combat festival at Claregalway castle in Galway, Ireland September 29, 2018.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "Riteriai kovojo su kardais viduram\u017ei\u0173 kovos \u0161vent\u0117je Klairo galio pilyje, Galvejus, Airijoje, 2018 m. rugs\u0117jo 29 d.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Riteriai kovojo su kardais viduram\u017ei\u0173 kovos \u0161vent\u0117je Klairo galio pilyje, Galvejus, Airijoje, 2018 m. rugs\u0117jo 29 d.}}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 61, "output_tokens": 119, "total_tokens": 180}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.6231e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-lt-en_636", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nRedshirt season no longer a possibility for Alabama's Hurts\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence is a sports headline referring to the NCAA concept of redshirting (sitting out a season to preserve eligibility). In Lithuanian sports terminology this is rendered as \u201craudonojo mar\u0161kin\u0117lio sezonas.\u201d\n\nA natural, idiomatic translation therefore reads:\n\n\u201cAlabamos Hurtsui raudonojo mar\u0161kin\u0117lio sezonas neb\u0117ra galimas.\u201d\n\n(The proper noun \u201cHurts\u201d remains unchanged, the possessive \u201cAlabama\u2019s\u201d becomes the Lithuanian dative \u201cAlabamos \u2026 -ui,\u201d and \u201cno longer a possibility\u201d is expressed concisely by \u201cneb\u0117ra galimas.\u201d)\n\n\\boxed{Alabamos Hurtsui raud. mar\u0161kin\u0117lio sezonas neb\u0117ra galimas}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 163, "output_tokens": 151, "total_tokens": 314}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00058125, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-lt-en_643", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nIt is unofficially stated that only 1% of certificates that certify packaging waste management were issued of the intended recycling tasks\u201d, said Mr. Gentvilas in the press release.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\u201eNeoficialiai teigiama, kad tik 1 proc. sertifikat\u0173, patvirtinan\u010di\u0173 pakuot\u0117s atliek\u0173 tvarkym\u0105, buvo i\u0161duota numatytiems perdirbimo u\u017edaviniams\u201c, \u2013 prane\u0161ime spaudai sak\u0117 p. Gentvilas.\n\n\\boxed{{\u201eNeoficialiai teigiama, kad tik 1 proc. sertifikat\u0173, patvirtinan\u010di\u0173 pakuot\u0117s atliek\u0173 tvarkym\u0105, buvo i\u0161duota numatytiems perdirbimo u\u017edaviniams\u201c, \u2013 prane\u0161ime spaudai sak\u0117 p. Gentvilas.}}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 66, "output_tokens": 163, "total_tokens": 229}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 2.0986000000000002e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-lt-en_655", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\n72-year-old Fidelity bets on the future with blockchain, virtual reality and AI\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "72 met\u0173 am\u017eiaus \u201eFidelity\u201c stato \u012f ateit\u012f su blockchain, virtualia realybe ir dirbtiniu intelektu\n\n\\boxed{{72 met\u0173 am\u017eiaus \u201eFidelity\u201c stato \u012f ateit\u012f su blockchain, virtualia realybe ir dirbtiniu intelektu}}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 48, "output_tokens": 75, "total_tokens": 123}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.0908e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-lt-en_755", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nSarah Palin's oldest son charged with beating up his father\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence is a news headline, so the Lithuanian rendering must preserve a concise, headline-style structure while remaining grammatically natural.  \n\n- \u201cSarah Palin\u201d remains unchanged as a proper name.  \n- \u201coldest son\u201d translates directly as \u201cvyriausias s\u016bnus.\u201d  \n- \u201ccharged with\u201d is rendered by the headline-appropriate passive participle \u201ckaltinamas.\u201d  \n- \u201cbeating up\u201d is nominalized to the concise noun \u201ct\u0117vo sumu\u0161imu\u201d (instrumental case), which is the conventional way Lithuanian headlines express the charge.  \n\nPutting these elements together yields the compact, idiomatic headline  \n\nSarah Palin vyriausias s\u016bnus kaltinamas t\u0117vo sumu\u0161imu.\n\n\\boxed{Sarah Palin vyriausias s\u016bnus kaltinamas t\u0117vo sumu\u0161imu}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 162, "output_tokens": 164, "total_tokens": 326}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.0006125, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-lt-en_798", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nIt will not appear.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "To translate the sentence \"It will not appear\" into Lithuanian, you can use the following options depending on the context:\n\n1. **Tai nepasirodys.** (Most common and neutral)\n2. **Tai neatsiras.** (Used if referring to something that will not come into existence or become visible)\n\nThe most standard translation is:\n\n\\boxed{Tai nepasirodys.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 28, "output_tokens": 82, "total_tokens": 110}, "provider": "Google AI Studio", "model_used": "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "requested_model": "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "invoked_at": "2026-08-05T17:01:18.359498+00:00"}, "cost": 0.00013, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-lt-en_883", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Lithuanian.\n\nIf you notice any symptoms of breast cancer, the NHS advises that you see your GP as soon as possible.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The sentence can be translated by rendering each clause naturally while preserving UK-specific terms (NHS, GP) that have no direct Lithuanian equivalent:\n\n- \u201cIf you notice any symptoms of breast cancer\u201d becomes the conditional clause \u201cJei pastebite bet koki\u0173 kr\u016bties v\u0117\u017eio simptom\u0173\u201d.  \n- \u201cthe NHS advises that you see your GP as soon as possible\u201d becomes \u201cNHS pataria kuo grei\u010diau kreiptis \u012f savo \u0161eimos gydytoj\u0105\u201d, where \u201c\u0161eimos gydytojas\u201d is the conventional Lithuanian term for a general practitioner.\n\nCombining the two parts yields the complete, idiomatic translation:\n\nJei pastebite bet koki\u0173 kr\u016bties v\u0117\u017eio simptom\u0173, NHS pataria kuo grei\u010diau kreiptis \u012f savo \u0161eimos gydytoj\u0105.\n\n\\boxed{Jei pastebite bet koki\u0173 kr\u016bties v\u0117\u017eio simptom\u0173, NHS pataria kuo grei\u010diau kreiptis \u012f savo \u0161eimos gydytoj\u0105.}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 172, "output_tokens": 201, "total_tokens": 373}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.0007175, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-ru-en_222", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Russian.\n\nHardy was born in 1925 in the English resort town of Cheltenham.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\u0425\u0430\u0440\u0434\u0438 \u0440\u043e\u0434\u0438\u043b\u0441\u044f \u0432 1925 \u0433\u043e\u0434\u0443 \u0432 \u0430\u043d\u0433\u043b\u0438\u0439\u0441\u043a\u043e\u043c \u043a\u0443\u0440\u043e\u0440\u0442\u043d\u043e\u043c \u0433\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0434\u0435 \u0427\u0435\u043b\u0442\u043d\u0435\u043c.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{\u0425\u0430\u0440\u0434\u0438 \u0440\u043e\u0434\u0438\u043b\u0441\u044f \u0432 1925 \u0433\u043e\u0434\u0443 \u0432 \u0430\u043d\u0433\u043b\u0438\u0439\u0441\u043a\u043e\u043c \u043a\u0443\u0440\u043e\u0440\u0442\u043d\u043e\u043c \u0433\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0434\u0435 \u0427\u0435\u043b\u0442\u043d\u0435\u043c.}}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 49, "output_tokens": 57, "total_tokens": 106}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 9.179e-06, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-ru-en_98", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Russian.\n\nWorld Championships 2017: Neil Black praises Scottish members of Team GB\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\u0427\u0435\u043c\u043f\u0438\u043e\u043d\u0430\u0442 \u043c\u0438\u0440\u0430 2017: \u041d\u0438\u043b \u0411\u043b\u044d\u043a \u0445\u0432\u0430\u043b\u0438\u0442 \u0448\u043e\u0442\u043b\u0430\u043d\u0434\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0445 \u0447\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043e\u0432 \u043a\u043e\u043c\u0430\u043d\u0434\u044b \u0412\u0435\u043b\u0438\u043a\u043e\u0431\u0440\u0438\u0442\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0438\n\n\\boxed{{\u0427\u0435\u043c\u043f\u0438\u043e\u043d\u0430\u0442 \u043c\u0438\u0440\u0430 2017: \u041d\u0438\u043b \u0411\u043b\u044d\u043a \u0445\u0432\u0430\u043b\u0438\u0442 \u0448\u043e\u0442\u043b\u0430\u043d\u0434\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0445 \u0447\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043e\u0432 \u043a\u043e\u043c\u0430\u043d\u0434\u044b \u0412\u0435\u043b\u0438\u043a\u043e\u0431\u0440\u0438\u0442\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0438}}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 45, "output_tokens": 76, "total_tokens": 121}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.0794999999999999e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-zh-en_170", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nIn the history of the Grammy Awards, Beyonc\u00e9 and Adele are the two female singers who have won the most Grammy Awards in a single year.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\u5728\u683c\u83b1\u7f8e\u5956\u7684\u5386\u53f2\u4e0a\uff0c\u78a7\u6602\u4e1d\u548c\u963f\u9edb\u5c14\u662f\u5728\u5355\u4e00\u5e74\u4efd\u4e2d\u83b7\u5f97\u6700\u591a\u683c\u83b1\u7f8e\u5956\u7684\u4e24\u4f4d\u5973\u6b4c\u624b\u3002\n\n\\boxed{\u5728\u683c\u83b1\u7f8e\u5956\u53f2\u4e0a\uff0c\u78a7\u6602\u4e1d\u548c\u963f\u9edb\u5c14\u662f\u5728\u5355\u4e00\u5e74\u4efd\u8d62\u5f97\u6700\u591a\u683c\u83b1\u7f8e\u5956\u7684\u4e24\u4f4d\u5973\u6b4c\u624b\u3002}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 179, "output_tokens": 64, "total_tokens": 243}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00038375, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-zh-en_195", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nThe first China International Import Expo will be held in Shanghai from November 5th-10th, 2018.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\\boxed{\u9996\u5c4a\u4e2d\u56fd\u56fd\u9645\u8fdb\u53e3\u535a\u89c8\u4f1a\u5c06\u4e8e2018\u5e7411\u67085\u65e5\u81f310\u65e5\u5728\u4e0a\u6d77\u4e3e\u884c\u3002}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 55, "output_tokens": 26, "total_tokens": 81}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 6.5049999999999996e-06, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-zh-en_196", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nThree companies from Mainland China made the 2011 Top 50 list. In addition 2nd place PetroChina, Sinopec and CNOOC were ranked 9th and 15th, respectively.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\u4e2d\u56fd\u5927\u9646\u6709\u4e09\u5bb6\u516c\u53f8\u8fdb\u51652011\u5e74Top 50\u699c\u5355\u3002\u6b64\u5916\uff0c\u4f4d\u5217\u7b2c\u4e8c\u7684\u4e2d\u56fd\u77f3\u6cb9\u3001\u4e2d\u56fd\u77f3\u5316\u548c\u4e2d\u6d77\u6cb9\u5206\u522b\u6392\u540d\u7b2c9\u548c\u7b2c15\u3002\n\nThe original text consists of two sentences that must be rendered accurately while preserving meaning, company names, and ranking information.  \n\n- The first sentence states that three mainland Chinese firms appeared on the 2011 Top-50 list; the natural Chinese equivalent is \u201c\u4e2d\u56fd\u5927\u9646\u6709\u4e09\u5bb6\u516c\u53f8\u8fdb\u51652011\u5e74Top 50\u699c\u5