e champions of two pair games at the same time.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "\u5728\u4e2d\u56fd\u7fbd\u6bdb\u7403\u961f\u53c2\u52a0\u51b3\u8d5b\u7684\u5386\u53f2\u4e0a\uff0c\u4ece\u6765\u6ca1\u6709\u4eba\u540c\u65f6\u8d62\u5f97\u4e24\u9879\u53cc\u6253\u6bd4\u8d5b\u7684\u51a0\u519b\u3002\n\nThe English sentence is somewhat awkward and appears to have been written by a non-native speaker, so the translation prioritizes natural, idiomatic Chinese while preserving the original meaning. Key renderings include:\n- \u201cIn the history of \u2026 playing in the finals\u201d \u2192 \u201c\u5728\u4e2d\u56fd\u7fbd\u6bdb\u7403\u961f\u53c2\u52a0\u51b3\u8d5b\u7684\u5386\u53f2\u4e0a\u201d\n- \u201cno one has ever\u201d \u2192 \u201c\u4ece\u6765\u6ca1\u6709\u4eba\u201d\n- \u201cwon the champions of two pair games\u201d \u2192 \u201c\u540c\u65f6\u8d62\u5f97\u4e24\u9879\u53cc\u6253\u6bd4\u8d5b\u7684\u51a0\u519b\u201d (where \u201cpair games\u201d is rendered as the standard badminton term \u201c\u53cc\u6253\u6bd4\u8d5b\u201d).\n\nThe result is a fluent, concise Chinese sentence that conveys the intended sense without adding or omitting information.\n\n\\boxed{\u5728\u4e2d\u56fd\u7fbd\u6bdb\u7403\u961f\u53c2\u52a0\u51b3\u8d5b\u7684\u5386\u53f2\u4e0a\uff0c\u4ece\u6765\u6ca1\u6709\u4eba\u540c\u65f6\u8d62\u5f97\u4e24\u9879\u53cc\u6253\u6bd4\u8d5b\u7684\u51a0\u519b\u3002}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 178, "output_tokens": 180, "total_tokens": 358}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.0006725, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "WMT19-zh-en_674", "prompt": "Translate the following sentence from English to Chinese.\n\nSince the earth\u2019s inner core is thousands of kilometers deep, it is very difficult to explore the characteristics of its movement and change.\n\nProvide your final answer in \\box